<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.280" end="00:00:08.240" style="s2">Bow to heaven and earth.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.560" end="00:00:11.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nightmare start work by day.</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.240" end="00:00:13.519" style="s2">Read all night then die</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.599" end="00:00:15.200" style="s2">and wake up as the villain in the book.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.519" end="00:00:15.839" style="s2">Yan Chong is canon fought her first</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.200" end="00:00:19.480" style="s2">wife.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.839" end="00:00:19.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bow to the parents.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.880" end="00:00:28.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This girl, didn&#39;t she refuse to bow with</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.640" end="00:00:31.039" style="s2">a chicken? I thought she was tough, but</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.880" end="00:00:32.880" style="s2">put a gun to her head. She folds fast.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.039" end="00:00:34.559" style="s2">He ignores her. Mary into the marshall&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.880" end="00:00:36.320" style="s2">mansion. And you&#39;re in for a world of</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.559" end="00:00:40.040" style="s2">pain. Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.320" end="00:00:40.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bow to each other.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.680" end="00:00:49.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hilarious. She&#39;s literally bowing to a</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.000" end="00:00:49.000" style="s2">chicken.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.239" end="00:01:02.239" style="s2">Chang must have been held up. He&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.440" end="00:01:03.680" style="s2">definitely make it back tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.239" end="00:01:05.280" style="s2">Whether Yenjanga comes back or not</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.680" end="00:01:09.320" style="s2">doesn&#39;t matter as long as he doesn&#39;t get</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.280" end="00:01:09.320" style="s2">me like in the original book.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.400" end="00:01:39.479" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.079" end="00:01:57.439" style="s2">The young marshall sent an ambush here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.439" end="00:01:59.680" style="s2">They deliberately wanted you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.439" end="00:02:01.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He doesn&#39;t have the guts.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.680" end="00:02:05.399" style="s2">Take him back for interrogation.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.759" end="00:02:05.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.759" end="00:02:09.599" style="s2">Marshall&#39;s forcing her to bow with a</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.360" end="00:02:13.280" style="s2">chicken. If you want me to handle the</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.599" end="00:02:15.599" style="s2">prisoner, go back</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.280" end="00:02:18.599" style="s2">with a chicken.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.599" end="00:02:18.599" style="s2">Bowing.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.400" end="00:02:26.840" style="s2">Resources too limited back then.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.879" end="00:02:30.599" style="s2">Something way more impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.160" end="00:02:42.560" style="s2">Hey, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.080" end="00:02:46.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My leg. Get me to a hospital now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.560" end="00:02:49.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone help. Hurry, hurry. Easy, easy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.800" end="00:02:50.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell happened?</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.040" end="00:02:52.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister-in-law, how could you push third</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.640" end="00:02:56.280" style="s2">cousin? I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.720" end="00:02:56.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.440" end="00:03:04.239" style="s2">First day she shoved third young master</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.760" end="00:03:07.040" style="s2">downstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.239" end="00:03:10.840" style="s2">She broke the third young master&#39;s leg.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.040" end="00:03:10.840" style="s2">A leg for a leg.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.400" end="00:03:19.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall, wait. Father,</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.239" end="00:03:32.879" style="s2">what are you doing</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.480" end="00:03:34.319" style="s2">to my bride?</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.879" end="00:03:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And here comes the future villain who</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.319" end="00:03:37.360" style="s2">has an affair with her own</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.760" end="00:03:38.000" style="s2">father-in-law&#39;s ninth concubine, Yen</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.360" end="00:03:40.159" style="s2">Chan.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.000" end="00:03:41.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s talking?</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.159" end="00:03:43.360" style="s2">The old man only has eight officially</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.840" end="00:03:44.080" style="s2">recognized concubines. Who the hell is a</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.360" end="00:03:46.000" style="s2">ninth concubine?</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.080" end="00:03:47.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re finally back.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.000" end="00:03:50.840" style="s2">Something came up. Got held up on the</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.840" end="00:03:50.840" style="s2">road.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.599" end="00:04:02.480" style="s2">So handsome. Such a playboy. Here for</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.920" end="00:04:04.400" style="s2">the stepmom romance.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.480" end="00:04:05.680" style="s2">Relax. I&#39;ll happily step aside for the</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.400" end="00:04:09.640" style="s2">ninth concubine.</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.680" end="00:04:09.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it really was he talking.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.400" end="00:04:14.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eldest cousin. Don&#39;t be fooled by her</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.239" end="00:04:17.280" style="s2">innocent act. Just now. Sister-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.879" end="00:04:19.280" style="s2">saw my necklace and tried to snatch it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.280" end="00:04:21.359" style="s2">Third cousin helped me, so she pushed</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.280" end="00:04:22.960" style="s2">him downstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.359" end="00:04:26.080" style="s2">This necklace was brought back from</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.960" end="00:04:29.040" style="s2">France by second cousin. If she asked,</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.080" end="00:04:30.720" style="s2">I&#39;d have given it. Didn&#39;t expect her to</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.040" end="00:04:32.639" style="s2">snatch.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.720" end="00:04:35.800" style="s2">Cousin, look at my neck. Where would I</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.639" end="00:04:35.800" style="s2">put it?</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.160" end="00:04:40.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam,</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.160" end="00:04:43.040" style="s2">care to explain.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.240" end="00:04:46.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t do it. So the young madam is</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.040" end="00:04:48.160" style="s2">implying that Yuner framed you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.080" end="00:04:49.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Second concubine. It was indeed cousin</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.160" end="00:04:52.960" style="s2">who framed me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.600" end="00:04:54.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall, you watched Yuner grow up. You</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.960" end="00:04:57.360" style="s2">know what kind of person she is.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.880" end="00:05:00.160" style="s2">Besides, Yuner has no grudge against the</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.360" end="00:05:01.919" style="s2">young madam. Why would she frame you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.160" end="00:05:05.199" style="s2">Sister-in-law. Yuner&#39;s mother died</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.919" end="00:05:07.680" style="s2">young. She had to stay at the marshalss.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.199" end="00:05:09.520" style="s2">Now you say Yuner framed you. Is that</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.680" end="00:05:12.639" style="s2">your way of trying to kick Yuner out and</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.520" end="00:05:14.479" style="s2">leave her with nowhere to go?</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.639" end="00:05:15.680" style="s2">You say inner framed you. Where&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.479" end="00:05:19.039" style="s2">proof?</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.680" end="00:05:20.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your daughter-in-law has proof.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.039" end="00:05:22.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, the evidence phase. Time to</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.880" end="00:05:24.000" style="s2">show you old relics of this era. The</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.639" end="00:05:28.400" style="s2">power of science.</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.000" end="00:05:31.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old relics. What power of science?</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.400" end="00:05:35.000" style="s2">What evidence? [clears throat] Show it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.520" end="00:05:35.000" style="s2">Bring it out.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.680" end="00:05:38.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just thinking about what I&#39;m about to</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.120" end="00:05:41.039" style="s2">do, I can&#39;t help but laugh.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.880" end="00:05:42.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a photograph. How is that</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.039" end="00:05:43.280" style="s2">evidence?</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.080" end="00:05:45.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The marshall told you to bring proof</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.280" end="00:05:47.600" style="s2">that you framed you. Why are you</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.280" end="00:05:49.600" style="s2">bringing this useless junk? This is not</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.600" end="00:05:51.520" style="s2">a photograph.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.600" end="00:05:53.680" style="s2">Earlier, when I was in the countryside,</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.520" end="00:05:56.400" style="s2">I saved a foreigner. He said this was a</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.680" end="00:05:58.720" style="s2">device he developed. It can capture and</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.400" end="00:06:02.000" style="s2">replay sounds from the past. I saved</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.720" end="00:06:03.919" style="s2">him. So, he gave it to me as a reward.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.000" end="00:06:06.160" style="s2">I found this thing fascinating, so I</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.919" end="00:06:07.840" style="s2">wanted to bring it to the marshall. But</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.160" end="00:06:11.120" style="s2">I didn&#39;t expect to run into cousin and</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.840" end="00:06:14.000" style="s2">the third young marshall on my way out.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.120" end="00:06:15.520" style="s2">I got nervous and hit the switch.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.000" end="00:06:18.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you use it?</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.520" end="00:06:20.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The button on the left is the recorder.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.319" end="00:06:22.160" style="s2">The button on the right is the player.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.720" end="00:06:23.759" style="s2">All the marshall has to do is press the</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.160" end="00:06:25.600" style="s2">button on the right and the truth will</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.759" end="00:06:27.360" style="s2">be revealed.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.600" end="00:06:29.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall, don&#39;t open it. How could such</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.360" end="00:06:33.039" style="s2">a miraculous thing exist in this world?</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.199" end="00:06:35.199" style="s2">She She said a foreigner gave it to her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.039" end="00:06:37.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if it&#39;s something meant to harm us?</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.199" end="00:06:40.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With all these people around, would she</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.440" end="00:06:40.800" style="s2">really dare harm me?</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.759" end="00:06:47.360" style="s2">Cousin Yuner feels awful.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.960" end="00:06:50.080" style="s2">Feel my heartbeat. Is it raising? Song</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.360" end="00:06:52.880" style="s2">Yun, this is your voice.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.080" end="00:06:54.720" style="s2">Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.880" end="00:06:56.960" style="s2">So, old relics, you&#39;ve learned something</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.720" end="00:06:58.479" style="s2">new. Too bad in this era. There are no</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.960" end="00:07:00.479" style="s2">conditions to make microchips, only</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.479" end="00:07:01.840" style="s2">primitive recording needles. I&#39;m a damn</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.479" end="00:07:05.120" style="s2">scientific genius, and I couldn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.840" end="00:07:07.759" style="s2">make a voice recorder. I&#39;m so mad</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.120" end="00:07:09.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; she made this. This era has no</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.759" end="00:07:12.720" style="s2">conditions to make microchips. Could it</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.520" end="00:07:14.639" style="s2">be? She&#39;s not from this era.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.720" end="00:07:15.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cousin [snorts] Yuner, you&#39;re drunk.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.639" end="00:07:17.680" style="s2">Isn&#39;t the one you like my eldest</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.759" end="00:07:19.280" style="s2">brother? Don&#39;t be like this.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.680" end="00:07:23.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, so you clearly like the young</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.280" end="00:07:25.840" style="s2">Marshall. Why are you seducing our awe?</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.039" end="00:07:28.000" style="s2">I I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.840" end="00:07:31.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You cousin, if you keep this up, I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.000" end="00:07:34.240" style="s2">take it anymore. Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.280" end="00:07:37.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See, cousin, I won&#39;t say a word.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.240" end="00:07:42.120" style="s2">I didn&#39;t see anything.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.520" end="00:07:42.120" style="s2">Cousin, Yuner feels so awful.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.759" end="00:07:47.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cousin, you&#39;re the one who insisted on</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.280" end="00:07:50.240" style="s2">falsely accusing me. I was going to</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.039" end="00:07:52.479" style="s2">cover for you, but this is too juicy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.240" end="00:07:54.720" style="s2">Cousins into Yan Chan. Yeah. And throw</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.479" end="00:07:57.120" style="s2">in the ninth concubine. This love web is</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.720" end="00:07:58.960" style="s2">absolutely unhinged.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.120" end="00:08:01.680" style="s2">Marshall, you must seek justice for our</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.960" end="00:08:04.000" style="s2">awe. You heard it yourself. Our awe</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.680" end="00:08:06.560" style="s2">didn&#39;t want this. The one who pushed him</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.000" end="00:08:08.400" style="s2">down the stairs was also Seir Yun.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.560" end="00:08:10.879" style="s2">Yuner, do you have anything to say for</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.400" end="00:08:13.039" style="s2">yourself? Marshall, forgive me. Yuner</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.879" end="00:08:15.680" style="s2">just had too much to drink. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.039" end="00:08:16.479" style="s2">remember what happened. You didn&#39;t mean</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.680" end="00:08:20.280" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.479" end="00:08:20.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were so sure before</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.120" end="00:08:25.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; now. Sobered up.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.720" end="00:08:32.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kneel and apologize. Now,</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.479" end="00:08:35.200" style="s2">third concubine, it&#39;s Sher Yun who was</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.320" end="00:08:36.719" style="s2">foolish. Shir Yun drank too much. Shir</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.200" end="00:08:39.279" style="s2">Yun apologizes to you and the third</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.719" end="00:08:42.560" style="s2">young Marshall. Get off me. What good is</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.279" end="00:08:45.120" style="s2">an apology? Will it wake a way up?</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.560" end="00:08:47.760" style="s2">Sister-in-law. Sister-in-law. I was</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.120" end="00:08:49.360" style="s2">possessed by greed. I was wrong. Please,</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.760" end="00:08:53.240" style="s2">sister-in-law, forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.360" end="00:08:53.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What shall we do with her?</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.760" end="00:08:58.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask me. Why not ask the third concubine?</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.560" end="00:09:02.720" style="s2">It&#39;s her son who lost his leg. Then</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.800" end="00:09:06.440" style="s2">third concubine will resent me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.720" end="00:09:06.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A leg for a leg.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.000" end="00:09:12.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those are father&#39;s orders.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.760" end="00:09:12.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.200" end="00:09:17.760" style="s2">Keep your head down and stay out of</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.800" end="00:09:20.399" style="s2">trouble from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.760" end="00:09:23.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn. This man is fine. Ninth concubine</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.399" end="00:09:23.880" style="s2">is eating good.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.080" end="00:09:28.880" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
