<p begin="00:11:34.240" end="00:11:38.560" style="s2">A month ago, the Lou family brought me</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.160" end="00:11:40.560" style="s2">back from the countryside.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.560" end="00:11:42.640" style="s2">On the way to the Lou estate, I noticed</p>
