<p begin="00:19:27.679" end="00:19:32.120" style="s2">wonder so many women are into him.</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.240" end="00:19:35.360" style="s2">Young Marshall, these men, their tongs</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.679" end="00:19:38.720" style="s2">have all been cut out. Looks like the</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.360" end="00:19:42.520" style="s2">second young Marshall&#39;s handiwork</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.720" end="00:19:42.520" style="s2">to the Marshall&#39;s mansion.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.880" end="00:19:49.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh dear.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.080" end="00:19:51.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall. Marshall, are you all right?</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.039" end="00:19:52.880" style="s2">Marshall. Oh no.</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.280" end="00:19:54.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tear out every fruit tree in the</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.880" end="00:19:58.039" style="s2">courtyard.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.400" end="00:19:58.039" style="s2">Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.600" end="00:20:09.039" style="s2">Father, nanny,</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.440" end="00:20:11.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; are you pleased with the bride I pick</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.039" end="00:20:13.520" style="s2">for you?</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.039" end="00:20:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, you&#39;ve known many beauties. Any</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.520" end="00:20:17.679" style="s2">you choose is special.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.440" end="00:20:19.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn right. Otherwise, how&#39;d you end up</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.679" end="00:20:22.480" style="s2">fancying his ninth concubine?</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.360" end="00:20:27.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said that? Since you&#39;re satisfied,</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.480" end="00:20:27.160" style="s2">settle down and stop angering father.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.760" end="00:20:34.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neil, kneel, kneel again. When will</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.080" end="00:20:36.640" style="s2">these people ever learn to stand?</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.240" end="00:20:38.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s her talking.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.640" end="00:20:40.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.640" end="00:20:42.480" style="s2">Ah,</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.240" end="00:20:44.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; it&#39;s a democratic government now. You</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.480" end="00:20:46.640" style="s2">don&#39;t have to kneel. Since she&#39;s from</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.880" end="00:20:49.039" style="s2">the future, and in the future, no one</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.640" end="00:20:53.240" style="s2">kneels. I don&#39;t have to kneel either.</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.039" end="00:20:53.240" style="s2">Father, must I still kneel?</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.679" end="00:20:56.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; H</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.880" end="00:21:01.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall, kneeling to serve tea has been</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.960" end="00:21:02.960" style="s2">the rule for centuries. The young</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.440" end="00:21:05.120" style="s2">Marshall took Yinching, but grows more</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.960" end="00:21:06.159" style="s2">lawless by the day. He doesn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.120" end="00:21:07.840" style="s2">respect you anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.159" end="00:21:09.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Second concubine knows rules well,</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.840" end="00:21:13.039" style="s2">raised a niece who openly seduces men</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.600" end="00:21:15.760" style="s2">and bites back at her own sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.039" end="00:21:17.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall, look at him. Yuner has already</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.760" end="00:21:19.679" style="s2">been punished for yesterday&#39;s incident.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.840" end="00:21:21.679" style="s2">still pushing us. Does he want to drive</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.679" end="00:21:24.320" style="s2">us aunt and niece to death?</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.679" end="00:21:25.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You rich. Do you still see me as your</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.320" end="00:21:27.919" style="s2">father?</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.440" end="00:21:29.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Foolish Marshall. So many concubines in</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.919" end="00:21:33.039" style="s2">this house cuckling you. Yet all you do</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.919" end="00:21:34.960" style="s2">is fear Yan Chanya. Mm. If you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.039" end="00:21:37.520" style="s2">fall, who will?</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.960" end="00:21:40.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll fall.</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.520" end="00:21:44.480" style="s2">And you, Shir Yun, just now after what</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.960" end="00:21:46.640" style="s2">happened, you keep your head down, too.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.480" end="00:21:51.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with the marshall? He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.640" end="00:21:51.240" style="s2">never spoken to me so harshly before.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.290" end="00:21:55.310" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.240" end="00:22:08.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This jade bracelet is the Jean family</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.000" end="00:22:08.120" style="s2">heirloom. You keep it. Thank you, nanny.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.960" end="00:22:12.520" style="s2">Father</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.520" end="00:22:12.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; H</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.159" end="00:22:22.320" style="s2">take it. Consider your monthly</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.559" end="00:22:25.200" style="s2">allowance.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.320" end="00:22:27.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, father. He two big gold bars.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.200" end="00:22:29.919" style="s2">Enough to buy a small house. All my</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.200" end="00:22:33.720" style="s2">getaway money.</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.919" end="00:22:33.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She still wants to run.</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.480" end="00:22:39.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Military government kept me. I heard</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.600" end="00:22:41.360" style="s2">cousin Yina was rude to sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.360" end="00:22:43.360" style="s2">She suffered unjustly. To show my</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.360" end="00:22:45.440" style="s2">remorse, I had people find an identical</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.360" end="00:22:48.159" style="s2">necklace overnight. I&#39;m giving it to you</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.440" end="00:22:49.440" style="s2">today as an apology. I hope you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.159" end="00:22:51.360" style="s2">accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.440" end="00:22:53.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knows Song Shyen used the necklace to</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.360" end="00:22:56.240" style="s2">frame me. Same one from him. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.840" end="00:22:57.840" style="s2">testing me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.240" end="00:22:59.760" style="s2">Second brother, you&#39;re too serious. The</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.840" end="00:23:01.840" style="s2">truth about cousin Shyun framing me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.760" end="00:23:04.240" style="s2">Everyone knows it. It has nothing to do</p>
<p begin="00:23:01.840" end="00:23:06.400" style="s2">with you. Besides, I genuinely think</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.240" end="00:23:10.000" style="s2">that necklace is beneath me. Second,</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.400" end="00:23:11.679" style="s2">brother. Don&#39;t take it to heart.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.000" end="00:23:15.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was thoughtless of me. How about</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.679" end="00:23:16.080" style="s2">this? Want any necklace? Just ask. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.200" end="00:23:18.000" style="s2">buy it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.080" end="00:23:19.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that supposed to mean? Think</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.000" end="00:23:21.120" style="s2">about it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.679" end="00:23:21.919" style="s2">A necklace meant for the young madam</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.120" end="00:23:25.360" style="s2">that you gave me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.919" end="00:23:29.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s not just your sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.360" end="00:23:29.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s the first daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.600" end="00:23:32.880" style="s2">You should bring something that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.799" end="00:23:34.159" style="s2">actually presentable. The third</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.880" end="00:23:36.159" style="s2">concubine must hate the second</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.159" end="00:23:38.320" style="s2">concubine&#39;s family to death. That&#39;s why</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.159" end="00:23:41.360" style="s2">she&#39;s speaking up now.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.320" end="00:23:44.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Third concubine. You came from nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.360" end="00:23:45.679" style="s2">Sold to the marshall&#39;s mansion. You have</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.000" end="00:23:49.200" style="s2">no right to speak here.</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.679" end="00:23:50.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You aren&#39;t you reigning her in?</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.200" end="00:23:54.840" style="s2">Serve you right if your own flesh and</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.720" end="00:23:54.840" style="s2">blood dismembers you one day.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.280" end="00:24:01.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.320" end="00:24:01.799" style="s2">Have some tea.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.200" end="00:24:10.240" style="s2">Insulent second brother, you grow more</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.000" end="00:24:11.919" style="s2">disrespectful by the day. How dare you</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.240" end="00:24:13.440" style="s2">speak to third concubine like that? Who</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.919" end="00:24:14.960" style="s2">taught you to talk to your elders that</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.440" end="00:24:16.480" style="s2">way?</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.960" end="00:24:19.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t the marshall&#39;s favorite the second</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.480" end="00:24:20.960" style="s2">concubine and second young marshall? The</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.039" end="00:24:22.799" style="s2">marshall actually speaks up for me for</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.960" end="00:24:25.039" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.799" end="00:24:27.360" style="s2">Wait, that&#39;s wrong. Marshall Yen isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.039" end="00:24:29.440" style="s2">like that. Could it be? Am I being mind</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.360" end="00:24:31.840" style="s2">read by the marshall? Father can hear</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.440" end="00:24:33.840" style="s2">her thoughts, too.</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.840" end="00:24:34.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t think anything. Clear your mind</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.840" end="00:24:36.799" style="s2">quick.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.480" end="00:24:38.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You low brat. Acting like this at home</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.799" end="00:24:40.400" style="s2">is one thing. No wonder the old guard</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.960" end="00:24:44.080" style="s2">and the military government look down on</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.400" end="00:24:46.240" style="s2">you. No manners at all. And you? Why?</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.080" end="00:24:48.640" style="s2">But in</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.240" end="00:24:51.279" style="s2">what do you know? Always sticking your</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.640" end="00:24:53.679" style="s2">nose in. Just get back to the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.279" end="00:24:56.640" style="s2">and keep third brother company.</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.679" end="00:24:58.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Scared me to death. Marshall Yan is</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.640" end="00:25:00.880" style="s2">even worse than Yan Chonga. Downright</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.640" end="00:25:02.080" style="s2">vicious. If he heard my thoughts, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.880" end="00:25:04.240" style="s2">done for.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.080" end="00:25:07.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father is a bad man.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.240" end="00:25:09.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Third concubine. I was out of line.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.840" end="00:25:10.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve already confessed. Signed and</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.440" end="00:25:11.600" style="s2">fingerprinted. Confirmed. It was the</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.640" end="00:25:12.960" style="s2">second young Marshall behind it. Young</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.600" end="00:25:14.880" style="s2">Marshall. These people had their tongues</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.960" end="00:25:16.640" style="s2">cut out. Looks like the second young</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.880" end="00:25:18.720" style="s2">marshall&#39;s handiwork.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.640" end="00:25:21.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since second brother knows he was out of</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.720" end="00:25:23.600" style="s2">line, he should kneel and apologize to</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.919" end="00:25:25.120" style="s2">third concubine.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.600" end="00:25:26.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eldest brother, you and sister-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.120" end="00:25:29.200" style="s2">didn&#39;t kneel when offering tea. Why</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.880" end="00:25:31.919" style="s2">should I kneel?</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.200" end="00:25:34.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fight. Fight. He Let me give you a taste</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.919" end="00:25:36.720" style="s2">of those classic TV drama Caddyy</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.080" end="00:25:38.960" style="s2">comebacks.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.720" end="00:25:41.440" style="s2">Forget it. Young Marshall, compared to</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.960" end="00:25:44.640" style="s2">you, second brother is indeed a bit</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.440" end="00:25:46.720" style="s2">lacking in brains and bravery.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.640" end="00:25:49.360" style="s2">He can&#39;t fight anyway, so poor manners</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.720" end="00:25:51.360" style="s2">don&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.360" end="00:25:53.039" style="s2">Besides, father can protect him just</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.360" end="00:25:55.919" style="s2">fine.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.039" end="00:26:00.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you calling brainless?</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.919" end="00:26:00.760" style="s2">Young Marshall, he yelled at me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.799" end="00:26:06.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who exactly are you pointing at?</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.880" end="00:26:08.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;ll bleed the mansion dry.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.320" end="00:26:09.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A scumbag helping outsiders. The</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.159" end="00:26:12.720" style="s2">marshall favored him, drained the</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.840" end="00:26:15.360" style="s2">coffers, then killed his father. What</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.720" end="00:26:16.960" style="s2">breed of ungrateful wolf is this? Eldest</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.360" end="00:26:18.640" style="s2">young Marshall. Young madam. Awa just</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.960" end="00:26:20.080" style="s2">wants to apologize for what happened</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.640" end="00:26:22.080" style="s2">yesterday. It&#39;s one thing if you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.080" end="00:26:23.520" style="s2">tolerate me and you. But Awa is the</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.080" end="00:26:25.360" style="s2">eldest young Marshall&#39;s own brother.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.520" end="00:26:28.480" style="s2">Can&#39;t you even tolerate him? Everyone</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.360" end="00:26:30.720" style="s2">shut your mouth. Stop arguing. Number</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.480" end="00:26:32.240" style="s2">two, kneel and apologize to your third</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.720" end="00:26:34.320" style="s2">concubine.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.240" end="00:26:37.039" style="s2">Father,</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.320" end="00:26:39.840" style="s2">the eldest daughter-in-law speaks sense.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.039" end="00:26:43.600" style="s2">I can&#39;t protect you forever. Tea for a</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.840" end="00:26:45.919" style="s2">wedding. No need to kneel.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.600" end="00:26:49.480" style="s2">But you&#39;re begging forgiveness.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.919" end="00:26:49.480" style="s2">Tame that temper.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.600" end="00:26:54.080" style="s2">Otherwise, out there, you&#39;ll bring shame</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.520" end="00:26:55.760" style="s2">to the marshall&#39;s mansion. The eldest</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.080" end="00:26:58.559" style="s2">son and his wife are laying down the</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.760" end="00:27:02.279" style="s2">rules for you. While you&#39;re at it, pour</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.559" end="00:27:02.279" style="s2">them some tea, too.</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.080" end="00:27:07.080" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.400" end="00:27:15.559" style="s2">Third concubine. Please have some tea.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.799" end="00:27:47.520" style="s2">Lovely tea. Teaching dogs manners is my</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.360" end="00:27:49.520" style="s2">specialty.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.520" end="00:27:52.559" style="s2">Our</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.520" end="00:27:54.159" style="s2">awa has never suffered such humiliation.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.559" end="00:27:56.320" style="s2">No, I absolutely won&#39;t let this fight</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.159" end="00:27:59.360" style="s2">today. The whole Yanganger family. All</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.320" end="00:28:04.200" style="s2">right. All right. It&#39;s rare we&#39;re all</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.360" end="00:28:04.200" style="s2">together. Let&#39;s go eat.</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.520" end="00:28:11.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young Marshall, young madam, please</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.520" end="00:28:12.799" style="s2">wait.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.120" end="00:28:16.080" style="s2">Thank you, young Marshall and young</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.799" end="00:28:18.559" style="s2">madam for stepping in. Away and I have</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.080" end="00:28:20.000" style="s2">little say here,</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.559" end="00:28:22.159" style="s2">but if there&#39;s ever anything you need</p>
