<p begin="00:38:31.200" end="00:38:37.280" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.760" end="00:38:39.040" style="s2">And he tastes good, too. Stop it. Yongya</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.280" end="00:38:40.960" style="s2">belongs to the ninth concubine. If I do</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.040" end="00:38:45.760" style="s2">this, I&#39;m the bad guy.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.960" end="00:38:48.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bad guy? She&#39;s cutest when she&#39;s asleep.</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.760" end="00:38:51.960" style="s2">You kept me up all night.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.000" end="00:38:51.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kept you up all night.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.560" end="00:38:56.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.160" end="00:38:58.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know you snored all night last</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.240" end="00:39:00.480" style="s2">night?</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.400" end="00:39:02.000" style="s2">Couldn&#39;t wake you. It was so loud. Nanny</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.480" end="00:39:05.720" style="s2">knocked on the door. Said you were</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.000" end="00:39:05.720" style="s2">keeping father awake.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.839" end="00:39:09.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that sleeping incense really that</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.520" end="00:39:10.720" style="s2">strong? How embarrassing.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.599" end="00:39:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s something even more</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.720" end="00:39:17.040" style="s2">embarrassing. Oh, you were so loud.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.720" end="00:39:21.839" style="s2">I had no choice but to kiss you to stop</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.040" end="00:39:24.560" style="s2">the snoring. So many kisses I&#39;m beat.</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.839" end="00:39:27.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. Don&#39;t say another word. Uggh.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.560" end="00:39:27.960" style="s2">I&#39;m not listening.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.480" end="00:39:35.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did any of you hear snoring last night?</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.920" end="00:39:39.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, that sound. Wave after wave. Our</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.599" end="00:39:39.240" style="s2">marshall never snores.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.720" end="00:39:44.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, I&#39;m worn out.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.079" end="00:39:53.000" style="s2">This kid, he&#39;s really fallen for her. I</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.520" end="00:39:53.000" style="s2">owe you my life.</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.400" end="00:39:58.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s your brother?</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.320" end="00:40:00.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I used to think that big brother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.240" end="00:40:02.400" style="s2">fiance was lumin. The bride was swapped</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.480" end="00:40:03.760" style="s2">suddenly,</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.400" end="00:40:05.440" style="s2">but now seeing how well big brother</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.760" end="00:40:06.560" style="s2">treats sister-in-law, nobody will dare</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.440" end="00:40:08.960" style="s2">say a word.</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.560" end="00:40:11.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. Before when the young Marshall</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.960" end="00:40:16.200" style="s2">was away every year on Miss Lou&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.280" end="00:40:16.200" style="s2">birthday, then the bride was changed</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.680" end="00:40:21.280" style="s2">and everyone was worried about the young</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.200" end="00:40:24.000" style="s2">madam. Trying to drive a wedge between</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.280" end="00:40:27.680" style="s2">me and Yan. He already suspects me as a</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.000" end="00:40:29.200" style="s2">spy. As if he needs you to stir the pot.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.680" end="00:40:31.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those birthday gifts sent to the Lou</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.200" end="00:40:34.079" style="s2">family. I arranged them myself. Nothing</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.760" end="00:40:36.240" style="s2">to do with Chang.</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.079" end="00:40:38.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine, nanny. I was just brought</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.240" end="00:40:40.240" style="s2">back from the countryside. Anyway, this</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.320" end="00:40:41.520" style="s2">marriage was originally my sister&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.240" end="00:40:45.480" style="s2">after all.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.520" end="00:40:45.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shouldn&#39;t there be a gift visit?</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.599" end="00:40:51.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cha, you don&#39;t need to go to the</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.200" end="00:40:55.200" style="s2">interrogation. Just accompany your new</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.839" end="00:40:57.760" style="s2">bride on her homecoming visit.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.200" end="00:41:00.240" style="s2">Uh, whoever&#39;s behind this is</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.760" end="00:41:02.800" style="s2">cold-blooded and ruthless. Over a 100</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.240" end="00:41:04.319" style="s2">caddies of explosives.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.800" end="00:41:07.440" style="s2">Even shooting them dead wouldn&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.319" end="00:41:11.040" style="s2">punishment enough.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.440" end="00:41:12.400" style="s2">Everyone&#39;s been rounded up,</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.040" end="00:41:13.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; but there&#39;s still no lead on the</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.400" end="00:41:15.599" style="s2">mastermind.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.200" end="00:41:17.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The last prince wasn&#39;t arrested. Seems I</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.599" end="00:41:20.680" style="s2">was overthinking. No one can hear my</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.680" end="00:41:20.680" style="s2">thoughts.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.240" end="00:41:32.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put someone on Jon Hanjo. Watch him</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.240" end="00:41:34.480" style="s2">secret. And keep an eye on Father&#39;s Man</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.079" end="00:41:37.119" style="s2">while you&#39;re at it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.480" end="00:41:41.560" style="s2">Yes, Marshall. You say Hanjo is the</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.119" end="00:41:41.560" style="s2">mastermind. Why no arrest?</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.760" end="00:41:47.040" style="s2">No need. Someone will watch him for me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.119" end="00:41:48.880" style="s2">Cha has escaped death with his little</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.040" end="00:41:51.200" style="s2">bride time and time again. Maybe he can</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.880" end="00:41:55.960" style="s2">hear her thoughts too. If those two</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.200" end="00:41:55.960" style="s2">can&#39;t be useful to me, then they die.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.079" end="00:42:01.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Book&#39;s visit was a show.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.520" end="00:42:04.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With someone as clever as me, the plot</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.440" end="00:42:04.880" style="s2">will still play out the same.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.960" end="00:42:14.960" style="s2">I heard when Lucian got married, the</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.280" end="00:42:18.079" style="s2">young marshall didn&#39;t even show up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.960" end="00:42:21.400" style="s2">Right. That country bumpin chicken wife</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.079" end="00:42:21.400" style="s2">city joke</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.240" end="00:42:26.240" style="s2">serves a right. It&#39;s all her fault. She</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.319" end="00:42:27.680" style="s2">stole my status in my man. If it weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.240" end="00:42:30.079" style="s2">for her, I wouldn&#39;t have been taken by</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.680" end="00:42:33.680" style="s2">those thugs and knocked up with this</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.079" end="00:42:36.560" style="s2">cursed thing. Ming away.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.680" end="00:42:39.440" style="s2">Nanny. Oh, Mingway. Why did you call for</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.560" end="00:42:42.720" style="s2">a doctor? Still not getting any better?</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.440" end="00:42:45.839" style="s2">Lucian poisoned you. When she comes home</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.720" end="00:42:48.160" style="s2">today, I&#39;ll give her a proper lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.839" end="00:42:50.000" style="s2">Nanny, I have a plan. One that gets both</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.160" end="00:42:52.000" style="s2">me and my sister married into the young</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.000" end="00:42:55.960" style="s2">Marshall&#39;s mansion. Then the L family</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.000" end="00:42:55.960" style="s2">will rise to the top.</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.319" end="00:43:07.440" style="s2">Father-in-law, mother-in-law, homecoming</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.079" end="00:43:10.319" style="s2">gifts. You&#39;re too kind, too kind. Having</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.440" end="00:43:15.839" style="s2">the young marshall here is our honor.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.319" end="00:43:17.520" style="s2">Come, sit, sit, sit, sit.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.839" end="00:43:19.599" style="s2">20 years ago, when our families arranged</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.520" end="00:43:21.839" style="s2">the child betroal, the marshall was just</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.599" end="00:43:24.079" style="s2">a low-ranking officer. Now he&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.839" end="00:43:26.000" style="s2">marshall ruling all four corners. The</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.079" end="00:43:28.000" style="s2">Lou family really married above our</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.000" end="00:43:30.000" style="s2">station.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.000" end="00:43:32.400" style="s2">They say don&#39;t air dirty laundry, but</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.000" end="00:43:33.920" style="s2">this concerns the young marshall. I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.400" end="00:43:35.920" style="s2">rather not keep it from him.</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.920" end="00:43:37.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.920" end="00:43:39.119" style="s2">what is it?</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.040" end="00:43:43.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The nation has its laws. The family has</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.119" end="00:43:44.800" style="s2">its rules. Shein Neil, here it comes.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.200" end="00:43:47.040" style="s2">Just like I thought.</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.800" end="00:43:51.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, what is the meaning of this?</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.040" end="00:43:54.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never imagined you this vicious.</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.839" end="00:43:56.000" style="s2">Ming already gave you the marriage and</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.319" end="00:43:58.400" style="s2">you still poisoned your own sister,</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.000" end="00:44:01.040" style="s2">leaving her vomiting for days.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.400" end="00:44:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jean, how could you do something so</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.040" end="00:44:04.800" style="s2">utterly beneath you?</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.720" end="00:44:06.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I live for a good frame up plot. This</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.800" end="00:44:08.880" style="s2">looming studied medicine abroad. She</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.800" end="00:44:10.960" style="s2">accidentally saved the last prince, Jang</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.880" end="00:44:12.800" style="s2">Hanha. Turns out the psychop prince fell</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.960" end="00:44:16.280" style="s2">for her and got her pregnant. She blames</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.800" end="00:44:16.280" style="s2">me for her nausea.</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.800" end="00:44:22.800" style="s2">Nanny, when did my sister eat what was</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.280" end="00:44:22.800" style="s2">sent from my courtyard?</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.359" end="00:44:26.960" style="s2">It was on your wedding day. You still</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.599" end="00:44:29.200" style="s2">won&#39;t admit it,</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.960" end="00:44:30.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; nanny. On my wedding day, I didn&#39;t eat a</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.200" end="00:44:32.880" style="s2">thing.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.880" end="00:44:35.599" style="s2">You said brides don&#39;t eat. No cooking in</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.880" end="00:44:37.599" style="s2">the small kitchen. And the main kitchen</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.599" end="00:44:41.440" style="s2">wasn&#39;t allowed to send me food. I</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.599" end="00:44:43.760" style="s2">starved all day. Have you forgotten?</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.440" end="00:44:46.319" style="s2">You still talk back. No fire that day.</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.760" end="00:44:47.920" style="s2">Fine. But the day before, the servants</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.319" end="00:44:51.760" style="s2">all said it. The food came from your</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.920" end="00:44:54.640" style="s2">courtyard. If not you, then who? Nanny,</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.760" end="00:44:56.480" style="s2">it really wasn&#39;t me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.640" end="00:44:59.200" style="s2">I know you were lost in the countryside</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.480" end="00:45:01.040" style="s2">for 16 years.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.200" end="00:45:03.760" style="s2">And you think Mingway enjoyed the life</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.040" end="00:45:07.040" style="s2">you should have had, but Minguay is</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.760" end="00:45:08.960" style="s2">where she is because she&#39;s clever</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.040" end="00:45:11.359" style="s2">and hardworking.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.960" end="00:45:13.200" style="s2">You&#39;re just petty. Even if the babies</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.359" end="00:45:15.920" style="s2">hadn&#39;t been switched, you could never be</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.200" end="00:45:18.560" style="s2">like Mingway.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.920" end="00:45:21.680" style="s2">Oh, young Marshall.</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.560" end="00:45:24.400" style="s2">Ci pulled these dirty tricks. It&#39;s our</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.680" end="00:45:26.319" style="s2">fault for not teaching her better. Young</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.400" end="00:45:28.160" style="s2">Marshall, let me explain. Young</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.319" end="00:45:29.920" style="s2">Marshall, watch my performance.</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.160" end="00:45:31.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, watch your performance.</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.920" end="00:45:34.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nanny, the servant said she ate what was</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.760" end="00:45:36.400" style="s2">sent from my courtyard.</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.160" end="00:45:39.040" style="s2">But did they say what she ate? Nanny,</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.400" end="00:45:41.599" style="s2">you never even asked.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.040" end="00:45:43.680" style="s2">What exactly did Lumingu eat? Yet you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.599" end="00:45:46.000" style="s2">so sure I poisoned her. Now who&#39;s really</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.680" end="00:45:47.839" style="s2">petty?</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.000" end="00:45:49.280" style="s2">You a country girl like you? How are you</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.839" end="00:45:51.200" style="s2">so sharp tonged?</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.280" end="00:45:53.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saying, &quot;How dare you speak to your</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.200" end="00:45:54.240" style="s2">nanny like that?&quot; Luming ate something</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.119" end="00:45:56.160" style="s2">unknown.</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.240" end="00:45:58.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And can&#39;t stop vomiting. Did anyone call</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.160" end="00:46:00.160" style="s2">a doctor? If an ordinary doctor can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.319" end="00:46:00.640" style="s2">cure her, shall I send for a military</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.160" end="00:46:02.000" style="s2">doctor?</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.640" end="00:46:04.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for your kindness,</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.000" end="00:46:07.359" style="s2">brother-in-law. But no military doctor</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.160" end="00:46:10.640" style="s2">is needed.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.359" end="00:46:12.720" style="s2">Why are you out of bed?</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.640" end="00:46:17.720" style="s2">Look how weak your sister is. You did</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.720" end="00:46:17.720" style="s2">what you did. Stop pushing her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.480" end="00:46:23.680" style="s2">Nanny has such a convenient memory. She</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.880" end="00:46:26.240" style="s2">can&#39;t recall what she did. Sis is young.</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.680" end="00:46:28.079" style="s2">She forgot.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.240" end="00:46:29.760" style="s2">Or does she just not remember? Young</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.079" end="00:46:32.240" style="s2">Marshall. This humble girl studied</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.760" end="00:46:34.800" style="s2">medicine abroad. I was the only Chinese</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.240" end="00:46:38.720" style="s2">student professor Wka ever accepted. I</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.800" end="00:46:41.040" style="s2">know medicine. Your sister&#39;s cakes.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.720" end="00:46:44.480" style="s2">They&#39;re definitely poisoned.</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.040" end="00:46:46.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poison cakes? I&#39;m no pumpkin.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.480" end="00:46:49.800" style="s2">Clumsy and careless. She made all the</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.560" end="00:46:49.800" style="s2">cakes herself.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.839" end="00:46:52.960" style="s2">I&#39;ve never even seen them, let alone</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.599" end="00:46:54.720" style="s2">touched them.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.960" end="00:46:56.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These were actually prepared by Nanny.</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.720" end="00:46:59.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you saying Nanny wanted to poison</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.800" end="00:47:00.880" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.280" end="00:47:02.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could I ever harm anyway?</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.880" end="00:47:04.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d better pray those wedding cakes</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.400" end="00:47:08.160" style="s2">had no slip-ups.</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.319" end="00:47:10.240" style="s2">If L&#39;s cakes are poisoned</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.160" end="00:47:12.640" style="s2">and word gets out, the authorities get</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.240" end="00:47:14.319" style="s2">involved. The Lou family will become the</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.640" end="00:47:15.920" style="s2">laughingtock of every high society</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.319" end="00:47:17.839" style="s2">circle.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.920" end="00:47:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These two are so stupid. They conspired</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.839" end="00:47:21.440" style="s2">to hurt me. I think he never</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.000" end="00:47:22.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, mind you, these went to the</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.440" end="00:47:24.560" style="s2">Marshall, too. What if something</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.960" end="00:47:26.160" style="s2">happened at the Marshall&#39;s mansion, too?</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.560" end="00:47:28.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not a single person at the Marshall&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.160" end="00:47:30.800" style="s2">mansion fell ill.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.480" end="00:47:32.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master, I really I truly did not poison</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.800" end="00:47:37.000" style="s2">those wedding cakes. Then what&#39;s with</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.960" end="00:47:37.000" style="s2">Mingua vomiting for days?</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.960" end="00:47:42.079" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll send someone to bring the</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.200" end="00:47:44.480" style="s2">military doctor here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.079" end="00:47:46.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need for the military doctor. Father,</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.480" end="00:47:48.400" style="s2">Mi is fine. Please don&#39;t lay nanny.</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.960" end="00:47:49.359" style="s2">There must be some misunderstanding</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.400" end="00:47:51.599" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.359" end="00:47:54.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So then this matter has nothing to do</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.599" end="00:47:56.319" style="s2">with my wife at all.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.640" end="00:47:59.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve given the young Marshall quite a</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.319" end="00:48:01.760" style="s2">show.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.200" end="00:48:03.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all Mingua&#39;s fault. Minguay offered</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.760" end="00:48:06.520" style="s2">tea to sister and brother-in-law to</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.520" end="00:48:06.520" style="s2">apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.880" end="00:48:15.880" style="s2">Brother-in-law,</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.400" end="00:48:24.559" style="s2">sister, it&#39;s all Mingua&#39;s fault to</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.400" end="00:48:25.760" style="s2">invite you to tea. Please don&#39;t mind.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.559" end="00:48:27.680" style="s2">Do you think the plot of the Lou</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.760" end="00:48:29.440" style="s2">family&#39;s return to the door is over? The</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.680" end="00:48:32.240" style="s2">good-looking ones are still in the back.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.440" end="00:48:33.760" style="s2">Lumingua drug the tea. Prepare to linger</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.240" end="00:48:35.520" style="s2">with the young marshall all night. Let</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.760" end="00:48:36.720" style="s2">Xiaou be a father and let me sleep with</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.520" end="00:48:40.400" style="s2">a soldier casually.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.720" end="00:48:44.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me be a good father.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.400" end="00:48:44.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not believe you do not stop.</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.800" end="00:48:51.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If this cup of tea goes down, I will be</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.119" end="00:48:51.480" style="s2">the housewife of the handsome mansion.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.440" end="00:48:58.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young Marshall, we shouldn&#39;t drink this</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.200" end="00:48:58.200" style="s2">tea.</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.240" end="00:49:02.000" style="s2">sister. Although you are the wrong Lou</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.920" end="00:49:03.440" style="s2">family, but the Lou family also gave</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.000" end="00:49:05.200" style="s2">birth to you and raised you for 16</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.440" end="00:49:08.160" style="s2">years. You should have a toast to your</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.200" end="00:49:11.440" style="s2">father, mother, and mother.</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.160" end="00:49:15.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam is right. This cup of tea.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.440" end="00:49:17.680" style="s2">Indeed, we should not be honored.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.040" end="00:49:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mingulu family has been when the darling</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.680" end="00:49:24.440" style="s2">spoils. Indeed,</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.000" end="00:49:24.440" style="s2">you didn&#39;t give me and your mother tea.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.559" end="00:49:28.880" style="s2">What are you doing here now? It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.359" end="00:49:31.880" style="s2">happy event for the young marshall to</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.880" end="00:49:31.880" style="s2">witness.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.720" end="00:49:38.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, Minguay should serve tea to father</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.200" end="00:49:38.440" style="s2">and mother.</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.040" end="00:49:43.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yuong, go and change a pot of tea.</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.280" end="00:49:45.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just use this pot of tea, don&#39;t you? The</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.200" end="00:49:46.880" style="s2">tea you offered me. And my wife is</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.520" end="00:49:50.359" style="s2">poisonous.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.880" end="00:49:50.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Non-toxic.</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.760" end="00:50:00.119" style="s2">Father, please have some tea.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.559" end="00:50:10.880" style="s2">Nanny, what do we do? There&#39;s knockout</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.280" end="00:50:12.720" style="s2">incense in this. What a mess. She really</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.880" end="00:50:14.079" style="s2">shot herself in the foot.</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.720" end="00:50:16.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even though Mingua is the L family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.079" end="00:50:18.240" style="s2">adopted daughter, I will still treat you</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.160" end="00:50:20.000" style="s2">like my own flesh and blood.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.240" end="00:50:23.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lu Mingua, let&#39;s see how you get out of</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.000" end="00:50:23.240" style="s2">this one.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.760" end="00:50:26.960" style="s2">Shien, what are you doing? Go get the</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.920" end="00:50:28.720" style="s2">military doctor in here.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.960" end="00:50:32.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.720" end="00:50:34.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would the military doctor come?</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.319" end="00:50:36.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To check whether this tea is poisoned.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.559" end="00:50:38.400" style="s2">Miss Lou has been vomiting non-stop for</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.079" end="00:50:41.559" style="s2">days. While he&#39;s at it, have him examine</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.400" end="00:50:41.559" style="s2">her, too.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.800" end="00:50:48.559" style="s2">Young Marshall, this tea has knockout</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.240" end="00:50:52.400" style="s2">incense in it. Knockout incense? How</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.559" end="00:50:54.400" style="s2">could it be knockout incense?</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.400" end="00:50:55.680" style="s2">Miss Lou, I&#39;ll take your pulse now.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.400" end="00:50:58.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.680" end="00:51:00.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, at Knockout Incense, then let me</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.079" end="00:51:02.640" style="s2">deduce something. Lu Mingua has been</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.079" end="00:51:04.880" style="s2">vomiting for days on end. Yet, she never</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.640" end="00:51:07.440" style="s2">called for a doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.880" end="00:51:09.200" style="s2">Could it be that she&#39;s pregnant?</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.440" end="00:51:11.280" style="s2">But how could an unmarried young lady be</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.200" end="00:51:13.040" style="s2">pregnant?</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.280" end="00:51:15.359" style="s2">So, she sees this chance to poison her</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.040" end="00:51:18.480" style="s2">own brother-in-law</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.359" end="00:51:21.200" style="s2">to make him a clueless daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.480" end="00:51:23.760" style="s2">How? How could she know my scheme?</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.200" end="00:51:25.119" style="s2">Lucian, you&#39;re lying.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.760" end="00:51:26.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; True or not, we&#39;ll know with one</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.119" end="00:51:29.720" style="s2">examination.</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.240" end="00:51:29.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Examine her.</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.920" end="00:51:37.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Lou is indeed with child 3 months</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.400" end="00:51:40.960" style="s2">along.</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.760" end="00:51:43.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ming, you you&#39;re pregnant. Whose child</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.960" end="00:51:46.480" style="s2">is it? You&#39;re not even married yet. How</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.920" end="00:51:50.319" style="s2">could you do something so</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.480" end="00:51:52.559" style="s2">so shameless? You. I&#39;m so furious. If I</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.319" end="00:51:54.720" style="s2">could die.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.559" end="00:51:56.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Lou family is a toxic mess. All</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.720" end="00:52:00.240" style="s2">schemes and no soul. A bad influence on</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.960" end="00:52:02.720" style="s2">the young madam. From today, the Lou</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.240" end="00:52:04.960" style="s2">family and the young madam are done. No</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.720" end="00:52:06.640" style="s2">more contact from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.960" end="00:52:08.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young Marshall. Young Madam, please give</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.640" end="00:52:12.599" style="s2">the Lou family one more chance. I swear</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.800" end="00:52:12.599" style="s2">I&#39;ll handle this properly.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.901" end="00:52:14.921" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.000" end="00:52:22.800" style="s2">You shameless wretch. I don&#39;t care whose</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.240" end="00:52:23.520" style="s2">child it is. Get rid of it now.</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.800" end="00:52:25.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.520" end="00:52:28.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; get away from me. We will never again</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.920" end="00:52:29.440" style="s2">have ties to the Marshall&#39;s mansion. I</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.240" end="00:52:31.599" style="s2">am not your father,</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.440" end="00:52:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; nanny. Oh, my poor girl. Look how</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.599" end="00:52:35.839" style="s2">they&#39;ve ruined you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.000" end="00:52:38.880" style="s2">The Lou family spent a fortune grooming</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.839" end="00:52:41.359" style="s2">you just so you could marry up. And now</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.880" end="00:52:43.440" style="s2">look at you. No one will marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.359" end="00:52:45.119" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing but a money pit. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.440" end="00:52:46.720" style="s2">a money pit. I&#39;m Professor Wanka&#39;s only</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.119" end="00:52:49.280" style="s2">female student at all of launching. The</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.720" end="00:52:51.359" style="s2">city is desperate for miracle cures.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.280" end="00:52:53.920" style="s2">Everyone will be begging me for help</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.359" end="00:52:55.520" style="s2">when I&#39;m in surgery. Ow, that lot of</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.920" end="00:52:57.839" style="s2">good that daughter of mine is now.</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.520" end="00:53:00.319" style="s2">Lucian is useless to us. We&#39;ll have to</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.839" end="00:53:02.800" style="s2">rely on you to prop up the Lou family.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.319" end="00:53:05.520" style="s2">So, here&#39;s the plan. Get rid of the baby</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.800" end="00:53:07.040" style="s2">first and stop angering your father.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.520" end="00:53:10.240" style="s2">Lucian,</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.040" end="00:53:11.680" style="s2">you country bumpkin uncou and clueless.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.240" end="00:53:15.079" style="s2">The day will come when you&#39;re all</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.680" end="00:53:15.079" style="s2">begging me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.800" end="00:53:28.480" style="s2">The young madam is so sharp and</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.640" end="00:53:28.960" style="s2">charming. I adore her more by the</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.480" end="00:53:31.359" style="s2">minute.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.960" end="00:53:34.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, I overdid the charm offensive.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.359" end="00:53:37.119" style="s2">He&#39;s completely fallen for me.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.559" end="00:53:39.280" style="s2">Young Marshall, you misunderstand.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.119" end="00:53:41.040" style="s2">I&#39;m shallow, vain, and spend money like</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.280" end="00:53:42.880" style="s2">water.</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.040" end="00:53:44.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doesn&#39;t matter. Isn&#39;t the marshall&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.880" end="00:53:48.040" style="s2">fortune just meant to be squandered by</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.720" end="00:53:48.040" style="s2">the young madam?</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.319" end="00:53:54.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I&#39;m from the countryside. Crude,</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.000" end="00:53:56.800" style="s2">illiterate.</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.000" end="00:53:59.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. Starting tomorrow, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.800" end="00:54:01.440" style="s2">personally teach you to read every day.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.040" end="00:54:02.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ninth concubine. Where are you? Come</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.440" end="00:54:04.720" style="s2">save me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.240" end="00:54:08.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ninth concubine again. Am I really</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.720" end="00:54:08.599" style="s2">that beneath her notice?</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.280" end="00:54:13.880" style="s2">As the young madam back to the</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.480" end="00:54:13.880" style="s2">residence. Yes,</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.800" end="00:54:21.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; men switch faces faster than you can</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.480" end="00:54:21.880" style="s2">flip a page.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.520" end="00:54:34.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young madam, the young marshall says</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.960" end="00:54:35.920" style="s2">he&#39;s sleeping in the study tonight. You</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.720" end="00:54:39.640" style="s2">need to wait up for him.</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.920" end="00:54:39.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Great.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.680" end="00:54:44.280" style="s2">The young madam said, &quot;Good and great.</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.960" end="00:54:48.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her attitude.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.800" end="00:54:53.200" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.400" end="00:54:55.040" style="s2">Just fine.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.200" end="00:54:59.960" style="s2">Your highness, this is a letter from</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.040" end="00:54:59.960" style="s2">Miss Lou. Give it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.400" end="00:55:08.119" style="s2">I will avenge you.</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.319" end="00:55:13.720" style="s2">The moment you get word of Lucian,</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.520" end="00:55:13.720" style="s2">report to me at once. Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.839" end="00:55:23.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today I&#39;ll show Yan Changi</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.119" end="00:55:23.559" style="s2">what it means to burn money like water.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.640" end="00:55:28.000" style="s2">Shopkeeper, bring out your most precious</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.559" end="00:55:29.760" style="s2">treasures.</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.000" end="00:55:32.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right away, honor guest. Please wait a</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.760" end="00:55:34.643" style="s2">moment. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.678" end="00:55:35.200" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.643" end="00:55:36.880" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.200" end="00:55:41.440" style="s2">Your Highness, Lucine is right over</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.880" end="00:55:43.040" style="s2">there. Everyone not involved. Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.440" end="00:55:44.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is bad. The young madam is in</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.040" end="00:55:47.119" style="s2">danger</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.640" end="00:55:49.520" style="s2">to corner the young madam.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.119" end="00:55:52.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mobilize everyone at the police station.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.520" end="00:55:52.920" style="s2">Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.839" end="00:55:57.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jang Hanjo.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.200" end="00:56:00.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The young Marshall&#39;s wife recognizes me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.440" end="00:56:02.559" style="s2">I won&#39;t lie. This treasure pavilion is</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.160" end="00:56:04.079" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.559" end="00:56:06.319" style="s2">What does the young Marshall&#39;s wife</p>
