<p begin="01:13:56.800" end="01:14:01.440" style="s2">them. 50 lashes and banishment from his</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.760" end="01:14:04.159" style="s2">state.</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.440" end="01:14:05.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, come off it. It was probably nanny</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.159" end="01:14:09.080" style="s2">wanting a grandchild and setting the</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.760" end="01:14:09.080" style="s2">whole thing up.</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.640" end="01:14:13.760" style="s2">Now hurry off to the military</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.159" end="01:14:16.960" style="s2">government.</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.760" end="01:14:20.560" style="s2">Oh, right. that Madam Chia</p>
<p begin="01:14:16.960" end="01:14:22.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam Chia was exposed as a spy after a</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.560" end="01:14:23.760" style="s2">whole night of torture. She was</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.239" end="01:14:24.480" style="s2">assassinated the very next day upon</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.760" end="01:14:26.560" style="s2">returning home.</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.480" end="01:14:28.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam Chia isn&#39;t the ninth concubine.</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.560" end="01:14:30.000" style="s2">Have I really changed the plot that</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.080" end="01:14:32.000" style="s2">much? The ninth concubine won&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.000" end="01:14:35.400" style="s2">showing up at all. Yan Chonga is mine</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.000" end="01:14:35.400" style="s2">and mine alone.</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.440" end="01:14:40.440" style="s2">You worked hard last night. Get some</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.440" end="01:14:40.440" style="s2">rest.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.080" end="01:14:46.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young madam. A letter for you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.960" end="01:14:56.320" style="s2">Luming actually reached out to me</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.640" end="01:14:57.840" style="s2">through Professor Wanka wanting to</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.320" end="01:14:59.760" style="s2">invite me to the Lou family&#39;s flower</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.840" end="01:15:01.600" style="s2">banquet. You want Professor Akasi to</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.760" end="01:15:04.880" style="s2">show up and give you face? Well, then</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.600" end="01:15:09.480" style="s2">let&#39;s see if you can handle it.</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.880" end="01:15:09.480" style="s2">Miss Mr. Wanka has replied.</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.000" end="01:15:25.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.360" end="01:15:34.880" style="s2">perfect timing. I picked out a fine</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.159" end="01:15:36.880" style="s2">husband for you. Take your pick. You&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.880" end="01:15:38.800" style="s2">be married by next month.</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.880" end="01:15:40.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, this lot of sorry rejects. How</p>
<p begin="01:15:38.800" end="01:15:41.040" style="s2">could any of them possibly be worthy of</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.320" end="01:15:43.840" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.040" end="01:15:45.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say? Your damaged goods and</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.840" end="01:15:47.199" style="s2">you&#39;re still being picky.</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.840" end="01:15:49.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.199" end="01:15:51.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The worldrenowned professor Aikusi will</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.600" end="01:15:52.239" style="s2">soon be coming to our estate as a guest.</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.360" end="01:15:53.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.239" end="01:15:55.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am the only Chinese student Professor</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.520" end="01:15:57.840" style="s2">Wanka has ever taken on. Professor, for</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.840" end="01:15:59.840" style="s2">Professor Wanka&#39;s sake, would naturally</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.840" end="01:16:01.520" style="s2">be willing to visit our estate.</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.840" end="01:16:03.360" style="s2">Professor Akusi has never made a public</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.520" end="01:16:05.120" style="s2">appearance. The moment he shows up at</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.360" end="01:16:08.560" style="s2">our Lou estate, even the Marshall&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.120" end="01:16:10.400" style="s2">mansion, will have to show us respect.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.560" end="01:16:12.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out. Get out. A bunch of broke no</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.400" end="01:16:12.400" style="s2">bodies still daring to come propose.</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.000" end="01:16:13.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Out.</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.400" end="01:16:14.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the one who told me to come.</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.600" end="01:16:18.159" style="s2">Unbelievable.</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.480" end="01:16:20.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In all of Armening Way could ever invite</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.159" end="01:16:22.719" style="s2">Mr. Aikus. [clears throat] So what if</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.719" end="01:16:23.920" style="s2">that country bumpkin is the real Aerys?</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.719" end="01:16:26.080" style="s2">When it comes to connections and</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.920" end="01:16:27.920" style="s2">capability, can she even compare to me?</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.080" end="01:16:30.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, don&#39;t just stand there. Spend</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.920" end="01:16:31.920" style="s2">whatever it takes. Arrange it properly.</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.080" end="01:16:33.199" style="s2">Send out invitations at once. Invite</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.920" end="01:16:36.000" style="s2">everyone of any standing in all of</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.199" end="01:16:38.000" style="s2">Hunching to come admire the flowers.</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.000" end="01:16:40.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes,</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.000" end="01:16:43.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; your highness, this is the Lou family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.320" end="01:16:43.320" style="s2">invitation.</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.080" end="01:16:51.679" style="s2">Professor Aikusi will also appear.</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.840" end="01:16:55.040" style="s2">At that time, you&#39;ll prepare a thick</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.679" end="01:17:00.199" style="s2">gift for me to go to Lofu. Remember, be</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.040" end="01:17:00.199" style="s2">sure to put Professor Aikus to my use.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.920" end="01:17:05.840" style="s2">Special drug developed by Professor</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.360" end="01:17:08.480" style="s2">Aikus. Both at home and abroad are</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.840" end="01:17:12.120" style="s2">looting. Make sure that Professor Aikus</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.480" end="01:17:12.120" style="s2">for my new government.</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.800" end="01:17:18.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother-in-law, 3 days later, Professor</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.080" end="01:17:19.280" style="s2">Aikuzi, I will come to Leofu to enjoy</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.239" end="01:17:20.960" style="s2">the flower banquet and invite my</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.280" end="01:17:26.520" style="s2">brother-in-law and sister at that time.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.960" end="01:17:26.520" style="s2">Please also be sure to come. Um,</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.560" end="01:17:32.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you know why the commander had to force</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.840" end="01:17:35.679" style="s2">his father with a gun in the first</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.960" end="01:17:40.520" style="s2">place? Let your sister marry you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.679" end="01:17:40.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you are a fake.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.120" end="01:17:45.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I came back from abroad, still a</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.040" end="01:17:48.080" style="s2">student of Professor Wanka. I will be</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.120" end="01:17:50.560" style="s2">your greatest help and sister. Just a</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.080" end="01:17:52.320" style="s2">country girl. The commander is afraid of</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.560" end="01:17:54.000" style="s2">your military strength, which is why he</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.320" end="01:17:57.880" style="s2">let you marry your sister.</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.000" end="01:17:57.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re my biggest help.</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.920" end="01:18:02.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you looking too high on yourself?</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.920" end="01:18:10.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you here for,</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.120" end="01:18:12.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; sister? I&#39;m here to send an invitation.</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.640" end="01:18:13.280" style="s2">Professor Aakuzi, I will come to Yoku in</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.560" end="01:18:15.840" style="s2">a few days.</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.280" end="01:18:18.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, is it all delivered?</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.840" end="01:18:20.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving yet. I&#39;m waiting to stay</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.000" end="01:18:22.159" style="s2">for dinner. Here we go. As soon as</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.719" end="01:18:27.000" style="s2">Professor Aikusi shows up at the flower</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.159" end="01:18:27.000" style="s2">banquet, when you ask me for something,</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.159" end="01:18:32.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the Lou family&#39;s flower banquet. You</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.159" end="01:18:34.320" style="s2">want to go?</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.880" end="01:18:36.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.320" end="01:18:38.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely. Wa will be there. And</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.320" end="01:18:40.320" style="s2">Professor Aikus, too. Of course, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.480" end="01:18:43.040" style="s2">going.</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.320" end="01:18:44.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saved Wanka and Professor Aikosi.</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.040" end="01:18:45.360" style="s2">So, is this Professor Aikosi a man or a</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.960" end="01:18:48.480" style="s2">woman?</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.360" end="01:18:50.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would he suspect Aikosi is a woman?</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.480" end="01:18:53.040" style="s2">It&#39;s been too long. I can&#39;t quite</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.239" end="01:18:55.920" style="s2">remember. Oh dear.</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.040" end="01:18:57.840" style="s2">Young Marshall, stop chatting. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.920" end="01:19:00.080" style="s2">going home.</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.840" end="01:19:03.080" style="s2">Young Madam is right. I was being</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.080" end="01:19:03.080" style="s2">insensitive.</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.564" end="01:19:05.584" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.719" end="01:19:12.679" style="s2">Whatever young Madam likes, I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.880" end="01:19:12.679" style="s2">sure she&#39;s well satisfied.</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.719" end="01:19:21.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Long time no see.</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.520" end="01:19:21.480" style="s2">Well, look at that.</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.520" end="01:19:25.440" style="s2">Welcome, welcome, Marshall. You honor us</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.520" end="01:19:28.480" style="s2">with your presence. The Lou residence is</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.440" end="01:19:30.159" style="s2">truly grace today.</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.480" end="01:19:33.040" style="s2">We&#39;re family by marriage. No need for</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.159" end="01:19:35.120" style="s2">such formalities. This time, I&#39;m just</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.040" end="01:19:39.239" style="s2">riding on the Lou family&#39;s coattails to</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.120" end="01:19:39.239" style="s2">finally meet Professor Aikusi.</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.280" end="01:19:42.080" style="s2">My daughter Mingway is hardly</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.400" end="01:19:44.880" style="s2">remarkable, but she&#39;s a student of</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.080" end="01:19:47.199" style="s2">Professor Wanka. She has connections.</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.880" end="01:19:50.000" style="s2">Marshall</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.199" end="01:19:52.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; not bad. My second and third sons are</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.000" end="01:19:56.280" style="s2">still unwed. A lovely match if they</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.640" end="01:19:56.280" style="s2">fancy each other.</p>
<p begin="01:19:56.320" end="01:20:01.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If not the eldest, the second or third.</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.679" end="01:20:04.320" style="s2">And that last Ching Prince, he can be</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.520" end="01:20:05.600" style="s2">the backup. Lumingua, let&#39;s see how you</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.320" end="01:20:07.280" style="s2">get out of this one.</p>
<p begin="01:20:05.600" end="01:20:07.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could it be that AI Cassie won&#39;t show up</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.280" end="01:20:11.120" style="s2">today?</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.840" end="01:20:13.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall, please come in.</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.120" end="01:20:18.280" style="s2">Marrying her wouldn&#39;t be so bad.</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.679" end="01:20:18.280" style="s2">She might actually be useful to me.</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.440" end="01:20:24.080" style="s2">I hear Miss Mingway has returned from</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.880" end="01:20:25.199" style="s2">studying abroad. A small gift. Please do</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.080" end="01:20:29.480" style="s2">accept it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.199" end="01:20:29.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. Second young Marshall</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.560" end="01:20:34.880" style="s2">Lucin. Your greatest talent is marrying</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.280" end="01:20:36.960" style="s2">into the young marshall&#39;s mansion. But</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.880" end="01:20:39.040" style="s2">after today, I&#39;ll be the talk of the</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.960" end="01:20:43.080" style="s2">town. Anings</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.040" end="01:20:43.080" style="s2">most sought after socialite.</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.640" end="01:20:47.280" style="s2">Where&#39;s his highness?</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.600" end="01:20:48.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His highness is occupied. Here&#39;s 10,000</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.280" end="01:20:50.400" style="s2">silver dollars. He asks that you take</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.960" end="01:20:53.199" style="s2">good care of yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.400" end="01:20:54.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.199" end="01:20:56.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was just making eyes at the second</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.560" end="01:21:00.000" style="s2">young marshall. How does his highness</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.400" end="01:21:02.239" style="s2">fall for a woman like that? Bug.</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.000" end="01:21:04.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has Professor AI arrived yet? Miss, what</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.239" end="01:21:06.239" style="s2">do we do? Still no one claiming to be</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.320" end="01:21:07.679" style="s2">Professor Aikesai.</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.239" end="01:21:09.360" style="s2">Professor Aikesai wouldn&#39;t toy with</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.679" end="01:21:11.120" style="s2">Professor Wanka. Professor Wanka</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.360" end="01:21:14.239" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t toy with me. So, Professor</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.120" end="01:21:18.120" style="s2">Aikesai will definitely come today. Oh,</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.239" end="01:21:18.120" style="s2">why isn&#39;t he here yet?</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.719" end="01:21:26.719" style="s2">Lu Jen, are you deliberately messing</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.480" end="01:21:29.280" style="s2">with us? We&#39;ve waited four whole hours.</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.719" end="01:21:31.520" style="s2">Professor Aikai, why hasn&#39;t he shown? He</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.280" end="01:21:34.159" style="s2">will. He will. Quick, bring the young</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.520" end="01:21:35.520" style="s2">lady in. If not for Professor Aikesai&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.159" end="01:21:37.199" style="s2">sake, who bother coming to you broke</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.520" end="01:21:40.400" style="s2">nobodyies. If you don&#39;t have the jobs,</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.199" end="01:21:42.480" style="s2">don&#39;t take on the job. Exactly. Everyone</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.400" end="01:21:44.560" style="s2">please stay calm. I did correspond with</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.480" end="01:21:46.480" style="s2">Professor Wanka. I asked him to contact</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.560" end="01:21:48.080" style="s2">Professor Aaki. In the medical world,</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.480" end="01:21:51.199" style="s2">reputation is everything. Since</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.080" end="01:21:54.320" style="s2">Professor Ai said he come, he will come.</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.199" end="01:21:55.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone here apart from Miss Lumingu.</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.320" end="01:21:56.960" style="s2">Who else could possibly reach the</p>
<p begin="01:21:55.440" end="01:22:00.080" style="s2">world&#39;s most renowned biologist?</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.960" end="01:22:03.199" style="s2">Professor Wanka. Then we wait.</p>
<p begin="01:22:00.080" end="01:22:04.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A case truly wouldn&#39;t deceive Wanka.</p>
<p begin="01:22:03.199" end="01:22:06.080" style="s2">She&#39;s already here. You just don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.960" end="01:22:08.480" style="s2">recognize her.</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.080" end="01:22:11.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Already here. Everyone who came today</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.480" end="01:22:13.679" style="s2">has been thoroughly vetted.</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.040" end="01:22:16.000" style="s2">Could she be AI Kai?</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.679" end="01:22:18.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whether she is or not, she&#39;ll serve my</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.000" end="01:22:21.120" style="s2">purposes.</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.480" end="01:22:25.159" style="s2">Why is father staring at Sheen? Can he</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.120" end="01:22:25.159" style="s2">actually hear her thoughts, too?</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.199" end="01:22:30.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is an outrage. They&#39;re playing us</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.120" end="01:22:31.360" style="s2">for fools. What a waste of time.</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.800" end="01:22:32.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.360" end="01:22:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go, go, go.</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.880" end="01:22:36.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.600" end="01:22:39.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall. Marshall, you have to believe</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.960" end="01:22:41.520" style="s2">me. There must be some misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.199" end="01:22:42.400" style="s2">Marshall. Young Marshall. Young</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.520" end="01:22:44.239" style="s2">Marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.400" end="01:22:45.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is there still a dog barking?</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.239" end="01:22:48.840" style="s2">Someone stop him.</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.840" end="01:22:48.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall,</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.639" end="01:22:54.960" style="s2">look what you&#39;ve done.</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.520" end="01:22:56.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The biggest joke in town.</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.960" end="01:22:57.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father, I don&#39;t know how it came to this</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.400" end="01:22:58.960" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="01:22:57.040" end="01:23:03.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out. You humiliated me beyond</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.960" end="01:23:04.560" style="s2">repair. You disgust me. No longer a Lou.</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.040" end="01:23:05.840" style="s2">Get out of the L residence.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.560" end="01:23:06.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father.</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.840" end="01:23:09.199" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.880" end="01:23:12.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father. Father, just give me one more</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.199" end="01:23:16.800" style="s2">chance. Father, your highness,</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.880" end="01:23:19.280" style="s2">open up. I have nowhere to go.</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.800" end="01:23:21.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Mingway. Open up, your highness.</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.280" end="01:23:23.040" style="s2">Absolutely not. You never went to the L</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.040" end="01:23:25.600" style="s2">residence today. Is high anyway? That</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.040" end="01:23:28.920" style="s2">child may not be yours. She&#39;s no match,</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.600" end="01:23:28.920" style="s2">your highness.</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.719" end="01:23:33.719" style="s2">Wa!</p>
<p begin="01:23:42.719" end="01:23:46.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do you all play with me? What did I</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.320" end="01:23:49.040" style="s2">do wrong? I am a physician of both</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.320" end="01:23:51.120" style="s2">Eastern and Western medicine. How dare</p>
<p begin="01:23:49.040" end="01:23:53.440" style="s2">you treat me like this? You forced my</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.120" end="01:23:56.639" style="s2">hand. As long as something happens to</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.440" end="01:23:59.520" style="s2">the Marshall&#39;s mansion,</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.639" end="01:24:03.239" style="s2">I will rise again for certain.</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.520" end="01:24:03.239" style="s2">I will rise again.</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.600" end="01:24:06.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here,</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.920" end="01:24:15.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; hubby. I want a hug.</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.840" end="01:24:28.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s got you so happy?</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.080" end="01:24:30.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today I taught my grand disciple a</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.000" end="01:24:30.639" style="s2">lesson.</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.280" end="01:24:36.239" style="s2">Did Professor Aikus come by today?</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.639" end="01:24:38.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.239" end="01:24:42.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, are you</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.719" end="01:24:45.400" style="s2">are you Professor Aikus?</p>
<p begin="01:24:42.159" end="01:24:45.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.920" end="01:24:53.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, let me tell you. I&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:24:49.679" end="01:24:53.239" style="s2">here for years now.</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.520" end="01:24:58.800" style="s2">I&#39;m a science genius.</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.880" end="01:25:00.960" style="s2">Even a tiny crumb that slips through my</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.800" end="01:25:03.920" style="s2">fingers would drive the scientists of</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.960" end="01:25:07.800" style="s2">this era insane,</p>
<p begin="01:25:03.920" end="01:25:07.800" style="s2">set a trap, waited.</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.840" end="01:25:15.600" style="s2">Sure enough, I caught myself a rabbit</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.679" end="01:25:17.679" style="s2">named Wanka.</p>
<p begin="01:25:15.600" end="01:25:20.000" style="s2">Wanka was the first to verify some of my</p>
<p begin="01:25:17.679" end="01:25:21.679" style="s2">theories.</p>
<p begin="01:25:20.000" end="01:25:24.480" style="s2">He traveled thousands of miles with the</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.679" end="01:25:26.159" style="s2">delegation just to find me.</p>
<p begin="01:25:24.480" end="01:25:29.199" style="s2">He even insisted on becoming my</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.159" end="01:25:30.880" style="s2">apprentice. So Lumingua is Wanka&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:25:29.199" end="01:25:35.280" style="s2">student,</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.880" end="01:25:37.760" style="s2">which makes Lumingua my grand disciple.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.280" end="01:25:40.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not a word of this to anyone but me.</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.760" end="01:25:40.760" style="s2">Understood?</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.000" end="01:25:47.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hubby, I&#39;ll do whatever you say.</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.639" end="01:25:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Turmoil now. Spotlight&#39;s risky.</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.120" end="01:26:00.600" style="s2">Aen, I will protect you no matter what.</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.239" end="01:26:10.840" style="s2">Madam, let me take you to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:26:12.239" end="01:26:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s been half a month since we swapped</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.440" end="01:26:17.600" style="s2">G1&#39;s gout medicine. How is she still</p>
<p begin="01:26:15.440" end="01:26:18.400" style="s2">perfectly fine? She even went to church</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.600" end="01:26:19.760" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.400" end="01:26:20.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The first man got into a car accident.</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.760" end="01:26:23.199" style="s2">Just rushed to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="01:26:20.880" end="01:26:24.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heaven itself is helping me. Does the</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.199" end="01:26:25.280" style="s2">marshall know?</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.239" end="01:26:27.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The marshall and young Marshall went to</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.280" end="01:26:29.120" style="s2">the outskirts to catch a spy. They won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.040" end="01:26:31.199" style="s2">be back anytime soon.</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.120" end="01:26:33.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get to the hospital</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.199" end="01:26:35.120" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.760" end="01:26:36.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Lou, was it you who saved the</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.120" end="01:26:38.400" style="s2">madam?</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.080" end="01:26:40.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.400" end="01:26:43.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam&#39;s bleeding badly. Blood bank</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.639" end="01:26:45.440" style="s2">short.</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.440" end="01:26:46.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I trained under Professor Wanka. Perhaps</p>
<p begin="01:26:45.440" end="01:26:48.960" style="s2">I can try to stop the bleeding.</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.960" end="01:26:50.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Lou, please step outside with me.</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.960" end="01:26:53.040" style="s2">There&#39;s something I have to tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.960" end="01:26:55.040" style="s2">Hey, wait.</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.040" end="01:26:58.800" style="s2">What? Says the second marshall. Madam</p>
<p begin="01:26:55.040" end="01:27:03.840" style="s2">can&#39;t wait. I can do it.</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.800" end="01:27:05.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drag her out. Yes. Metal something.</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.840" end="01:27:08.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s terrible, young madam. Something&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.920" end="01:27:10.639" style="s2">happened to the madam. I already warned</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.320" end="01:27:13.800" style="s2">the madam. The gout medicine. It still</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.639" end="01:27:13.800" style="s2">went wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.000" end="01:27:20.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young madam. The madam was in a car</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.679" end="01:27:22.639" style="s2">crash. The bleeding won&#39;t stop. And the</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.719" end="01:27:25.360" style="s2">blood bank doesn&#39;t have enough blood.</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.639" end="01:27:27.679" style="s2">The doctor says she may not pull through</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.360" end="01:27:29.600" style="s2">a car crash. It was the second concubine</p>
<p begin="01:27:27.679" end="01:27:33.280" style="s2">in her lot who arranged it. Go fetch</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.600" end="01:27:34.719" style="s2">Lumingua. We already did. That Dr. Lou</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.280" end="01:27:37.440" style="s2">acts so high and mighty. She won&#39;t come</p>
<p begin="01:27:34.719" end="01:27:39.679" style="s2">no matter what. Fools.</p>
<p begin="01:27:37.440" end="01:27:42.639" style="s2">We gave her a chance to shine. Why won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.679" end="01:27:44.480" style="s2">she come?</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.639" end="01:27:46.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s bad. The patient&#39;s gone into shock.</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.480" end="01:27:49.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hemorrhagic shock. She could die any</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.719" end="01:27:49.719" style="s2">moment.</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.760" end="01:27:52.960" style="s2">Let me in.</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.639" end="01:27:54.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucian, what are you going in there for?</p>
<p begin="01:27:52.960" end="01:27:55.120" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you mean to harm them.</p>
<p begin="01:27:54.239" end="01:27:58.600" style="s2">Madam,</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.120" end="01:27:58.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know medicine.</p>
<p begin="01:27:59.440" end="01:28:03.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This man here is, apart from Lumin, the</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.679" end="01:28:06.000" style="s2">finest surgeon in all of launching.</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.280" end="01:28:07.520" style="s2">Could your skills possibly surpass his?</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.000" end="01:28:09.840" style="s2">Doctor, whatever you do, don&#39;t let her</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.520" end="01:28:11.440" style="s2">in. Who knows what she&#39;s plotting? Yo,</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.840" end="01:28:13.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; madam, you&#39;re no doctor. This is no</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.440" end="01:28:14.960" style="s2">child&#39;s play.</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.040" end="01:28:17.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would I toy with a life? Second</p>
<p begin="01:28:14.960" end="01:28:20.639" style="s2">concubine. Why block me? The whole city</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.920" end="01:28:22.560" style="s2">knows</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.639" end="01:28:24.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lucian. The one with ill intent here is</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.560" end="01:28:26.560" style="s2">you, isn&#39;t it? Luming is a miracle</p>
<p begin="01:28:24.880" end="01:28:27.679" style="s2">worker of eastern and western medicine.</p>
<p begin="01:28:26.560" end="01:28:29.280" style="s2">And you just have to claim you know</p>
<p begin="01:28:27.679" end="01:28:30.880" style="s2">medicine, too. Isn&#39;t it just because you</p>
<p begin="01:28:29.280" end="01:28:32.000" style="s2">fear Lumingway? We&#39;ll steal your</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.880" end="01:28:33.600" style="s2">spotlight.</p>
<p begin="01:28:32.000" end="01:28:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just let her in.</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.600" end="01:28:38.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Second cousin. Both marshals are out of</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.760" end="01:28:41.040" style="s2">town. The young madam has gone in. If</p>
<p begin="01:28:38.960" end="01:28:42.400" style="s2">anything happens to the madam, how do we</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.040" end="01:28:43.360" style="s2">answer to the marshall and the young</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.400" end="01:28:45.520" style="s2">marshall?</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.360" end="01:28:48.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We try to stop her from here on. If</p>
<p begin="01:28:45.520" end="01:28:50.719" style="s2">madam lives or dies, the young madam</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.320" end="01:28:52.639" style="s2">bears full responsibility.</p>
<p begin="01:28:50.719" end="01:28:55.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once Chinuan is saved, I&#39;ll deal with</p>
<p begin="01:28:52.639" end="01:28:55.639" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:57.199" end="01:29:02.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Awa, why did you let her in?</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.760" end="01:29:04.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hearic shock. She could die any minute.</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.159" end="01:29:07.760" style="s2">Even Dr. Jing couldn&#39;t. If she can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.480" end="01:29:09.280" style="s2">save Chinuan, no one can. Some country</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.760" end="01:29:12.320" style="s2">bumpkin thinking she&#39;s got what it</p>
<p begin="01:29:09.280" end="01:29:14.000" style="s2">takes. Pathetic.</p>
<p begin="01:29:12.320" end="01:29:16.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All I&#39;ve got is textbook knowledge.</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.000" end="01:29:18.880" style="s2">surgical practice. Honestly, not as</p>
<p begin="01:29:16.159" end="01:29:20.560" style="s2">sharp as Lumingua.</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.880" end="01:29:24.000" style="s2">The biggest bleed is that penetrating</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.560" end="01:29:24.960" style="s2">wound on the chest. It nicked the aorta.</p>
<p begin="01:29:24.000" end="01:29:26.320" style="s2">Work with me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:24.960" end="01:29:26.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yo, madam. If anything happens to the</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.320" end="01:29:29.040" style="s2">madam,</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.960" end="01:29:32.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; if you want to save her, do what I say.</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.040" end="01:29:32.760" style="s2">I&#39;ll take full responsibility.</p>
<p begin="01:29:37.440" end="01:29:42.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall, how is she?</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.159" end="01:29:44.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall. Young Marshall. Thank god</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.560" end="01:29:46.480" style="s2">you&#39;re here. The madam was in a car</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.159" end="01:29:49.840" style="s2">accident. Massive blood loss. She&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="01:29:46.480" end="01:29:52.080" style="s2">in surgery for over 2 hours.</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.840" end="01:29:54.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s operating? Luming?</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.080" end="01:29:56.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, the young madam. Luming couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.639" end="01:29:58.719" style="s2">make it. The young madam insisted her</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.560" end="01:30:00.800" style="s2">skills were superior. Staked her own</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.719" end="01:30:02.800" style="s2">life on it. Swore she could save the</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.800" end="01:30:05.760" style="s2">madam. We tried to stop her. There was</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.800" end="01:30:08.000" style="s2">no stopping her. Now the young madam&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:30:05.760" end="01:30:10.400" style="s2">been in there for an hour. Lucian, if</p>
<p begin="01:30:08.000" end="01:30:13.040" style="s2">you fail to save Chin Wan, you won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.400" end="01:30:16.400" style="s2">live either. If Lucian really can save</p>
<p begin="01:30:13.040" end="01:30:18.560" style="s2">Jim, then she must be Professor Aisi.</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.400" end="01:30:20.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ain is Professor Aisi. She can</p>
<p begin="01:30:18.560" end="01:30:22.719" style="s2">definitely save mother. But if her</p>
<p begin="01:30:20.400" end="01:30:24.000" style="s2">identity gets out, father will never let</p>
<p begin="01:30:22.719" end="01:30:26.560" style="s2">her go.</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.000" end="01:30:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, the madam saved. Ah, the young</p>
<p begin="01:30:26.560" end="01:30:29.920" style="s2">madam skill.</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.600" end="01:30:32.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely extraordinary.</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.920" end="01:30:36.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="01:30:32.880" end="01:30:38.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn, my cover&#39;s blown.</p>
<p begin="01:30:36.239" end="01:30:40.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eldest daughter-in-law, thank you for</p>
<p begin="01:30:38.080" end="01:30:43.360" style="s2">saving madam.</p>
<p begin="01:30:40.880" end="01:30:46.000" style="s2">Father, it&#39;s my duty.</p>
<p begin="01:30:43.360" end="01:30:48.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aw, father, you got some old wounds from</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.000" end="01:30:51.360" style="s2">back in the day. When you have time, you</p>
<p begin="01:30:48.960" end="01:30:52.960" style="s2">could take a look at them for me, too.</p>
<p begin="01:30:51.360" end="01:30:54.719" style="s2">All those military doctors can treat</p>
<p begin="01:30:52.960" end="01:30:57.600" style="s2">father&#39;s wounds. That&#39;s plenty.</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.719" end="01:30:59.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? I got you a wife.</p>
<p begin="01:30:57.600" end="01:31:02.760" style="s2">And I can&#39;t even have her show me some</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.360" end="01:31:02.760" style="s2">filial piety.</p>
<p begin="01:31:03.040" end="01:31:07.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got so many devoted sons and</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.880" end="01:31:08.080" style="s2">grandsons. It&#39;s not a turn to play the</p>
<p begin="01:31:07.440" end="01:31:11.120" style="s2">beautiful one.</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.080" end="01:31:12.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this how you talk to me?</p>
<p begin="01:31:11.120" end="01:31:14.320" style="s2">the ninth concubine that Aeen keeps</p>
<p begin="01:31:12.719" end="01:31:16.080" style="s2">bringing up. If father really sets his</p>
<p begin="01:31:14.320" end="01:31:18.159" style="s2">sights on her talents and schemes to</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.080" end="01:31:20.400" style="s2">make her his own ninth concubine, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:31:18.159" end="01:31:22.080" style="s2">not impossible. When father gets old,</p>
<p begin="01:31:20.400" end="01:31:26.000" style="s2">when he&#39;s really too injured to move,</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.080" end="01:31:28.159" style="s2">then we can honor him. No rush. You</p>
<p begin="01:31:26.000" end="01:31:29.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, wait. I still need to avenge my</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.159" end="01:31:32.320" style="s2">mom.</p>
<p begin="01:31:29.679" end="01:31:35.760" style="s2">Tonight&#39;s crash, second concubine staged</p>
<p begin="01:31:32.320" end="01:31:37.600" style="s2">it. I once saved Wanka and Professor</p>
<p begin="01:31:35.760" end="01:31:39.760" style="s2">Alexis. They taught me some medical</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.600" end="01:31:42.480" style="s2">knowledge. Like first madam&#39;s crash</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.760" end="01:31:44.400" style="s2">blood bank low. Even if AU were here,</p>
<p begin="01:31:42.480" end="01:31:45.840" style="s2">you can&#39;t just use AE&#39;s blood directly</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.400" end="01:31:46.639" style="s2">to transfuse the first madam.</p>
<p begin="01:31:45.840" end="01:31:49.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not?</p>
<p begin="01:31:46.639" end="01:31:51.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Direct family blood triggers</p>
<p begin="01:31:49.440" end="01:31:52.639" style="s2">an immune system reaction. Since</p>
<p begin="01:31:51.040" end="01:31:54.560" style="s2">everyone&#39;s at the hospital today, why</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.639" end="01:31:58.400" style="s2">don&#39;t I suggest everyone stays and does</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.560" end="01:32:00.639" style="s2">a blood test? Just in case. Seion isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:31:58.400" end="01:32:03.280" style="s2">actually second concubine&#39;s niece is her</p>
<p begin="01:32:00.639" end="01:32:06.159" style="s2">daughter. Then who is Seyian&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:32:03.280" end="01:32:08.480" style="s2">biological father? Marshall, don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.159" end="01:32:09.920" style="s2">You&#39;ve been busy all day. Why stir up</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.480" end="01:32:12.480" style="s2">all this trouble?</p>
<p begin="01:32:09.920" end="01:32:16.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Woman, you dare betray me. Now you know</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.480" end="01:32:20.000" style="s2">fear. Stay. Eldest daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.000" end="01:32:21.520" style="s2">speaks since. If Ae were here today and</p>
<p begin="01:32:20.000" end="01:32:24.080" style="s2">transfuse the madam, it would have</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.520" end="01:32:26.239" style="s2">harmed her instead. Since everyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.080" end="01:32:28.800" style="s2">here, why not have each person leave a</p>
<p begin="01:32:26.239" end="01:32:32.080" style="s2">blood sample and check the blood</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.800" end="01:32:36.719" style="s2">relations while we&#39;re at it?</p>
<p begin="01:32:32.080" end="01:32:38.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is she so scared? Did she wrong you?</p>
<p begin="01:32:36.719" end="01:32:39.280" style="s2">to wrong the marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:32:38.159" end="01:32:41.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What nonsense are you stopping? How</p>
<p begin="01:32:39.280" end="01:32:44.719" style="s2">could I ever do? Just a blood draw,</p>
<p begin="01:32:41.360" end="01:32:48.199" style="s2">right? Draw. Draw.</p>
<p begin="01:32:44.719" end="01:32:48.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone draw.</p>
<p begin="01:32:50.159" end="01:32:54.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wasn&#39;t I at the hospital? How did I end</p>
<p begin="01:32:52.639" end="01:32:59.199" style="s2">up here?</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.800" end="01:33:01.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, you&#39;re my wife. Ha!</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.199" end="01:33:04.000" style="s2">Your Lou family disgraced yourselves in</p>
<p begin="01:33:01.040" end="01:33:06.320" style="s2">Aning. Only I&#39;d pay 10 grand to marry</p>
<p begin="01:33:04.000" end="01:33:09.040" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:33:06.320" end="01:33:11.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now, sweetheart, let me have some fun.</p>
<p begin="01:33:09.040" end="01:33:15.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My parents sold me for 10 grand. My</p>
<p begin="01:33:11.920" end="01:33:20.040" style="s2">fault. Rejected a prince. I was a rich</p>
<p begin="01:33:15.040" end="01:33:20.040" style="s2">ayer. And now I&#39;ve sunk to this.</p>
<p begin="01:33:25.440" end="01:33:29.679" style="s2">Auntie, what exactly are you so worried</p>
<p begin="01:33:27.280" end="01:33:30.719" style="s2">about? If the marshall finds out, Shir</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.679" end="01:33:32.159" style="s2">Yun is before I married into the</p>
<p begin="01:33:30.719" end="01:33:37.159" style="s2">Marshall&#39;s mansion. The child I had with</p>
<p begin="01:33:32.159" end="01:33:37.159" style="s2">the steward. Will Shir Yun even survive?</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.120" end="01:33:42.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shir Yun, I&#39;ll send you to the</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.239" end="01:33:43.760" style="s2">countryside first. Once this blows over,</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.320" end="01:33:47.040" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring you back.</p>
<p begin="01:33:43.760" end="01:33:50.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, what on earth happened?</p>
<p begin="01:33:47.040" end="01:33:50.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, no. Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:33:51.600" end="01:33:54.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By order of the marshall until the blood</p>
<p begin="01:33:53.120" end="01:33:56.080" style="s2">test results come out. No one leaves the</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.960" end="01:33:59.880" style="s2">Marshall&#39;s mansion.</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.080" end="01:33:59.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Steuart Lou?</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.040" end="01:34:07.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with Steuart Lou?</p>
<p begin="01:34:13.199" end="01:34:19.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re done for. We&#39;re done for. He must</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.520" end="01:34:19.159" style="s2">have sold us out.</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.360" end="01:34:23.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go confess to the marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.080" end="01:34:26.800" style="s2">Auntie,</p>
<p begin="01:34:23.840" end="01:34:30.400" style="s2">I didn&#39;t do anything. What did I even do</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.800" end="01:34:31.440" style="s2">wrong? Hurry up and go. Marshall, I know</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.400" end="01:34:32.800" style="s2">I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:34:31.440" end="01:34:34.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blood results aren&#39;t out and you</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.800" end="01:34:37.280" style="s2">confessed.</p>
<p begin="01:34:34.719" end="01:34:38.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Y is my child with Lu Yong, but ever</p>
<p begin="01:34:37.280" end="01:34:40.080" style="s2">since I married into the Marshall&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.320" end="01:34:43.040" style="s2">mansion. I haven&#39;t had any contact with</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.080" end="01:34:44.239" style="s2">him. What? I&#39;m actually the concubine&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:34:43.040" end="01:34:47.440" style="s2">child with the steward.</p>
<p begin="01:34:44.239" end="01:34:50.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get off me. You dared right under my</p>
<p begin="01:34:47.440" end="01:34:54.360" style="s2">nose to hide this for all these years.</p>
<p begin="01:34:50.080" end="01:34:54.360" style="s2">You&#39;ve been playing me for a fool.</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.400" end="01:34:59.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:34:55.920" end="01:35:02.159" style="s2">Marshall, spare us.</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.120" end="01:35:03.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t. No, I will not raise another</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.159" end="01:35:06.840" style="s2">man&#39;s child.</p>
<p begin="01:35:03.840" end="01:35:06.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother</p>
<p begin="01:35:07.040" end="01:35:11.760" style="s2">Marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:35:08.880" end="01:35:15.400" style="s2">A life for a life. The two children are</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.760" end="01:35:15.400" style="s2">innocent and</p>
<p begin="01:35:15.600" end="01:35:21.280" style="s2">is your own flesh and blood. I beg you,</p>
<p begin="01:35:18.800" end="01:35:23.120" style="s2">spare them,</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.280" end="01:35:27.960" style="s2">mother.</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.120" end="01:35:27.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Men, drag them out.</p>
<p begin="01:35:33.199" end="01:35:36.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.280" end="01:35:40.320" style="s2">get out of the Marshall&#39;s mansion this</p>
<p begin="01:35:36.480" end="01:35:45.239" style="s2">instant. Pretend tonight never happened.</p>
<p begin="01:35:40.320" end="01:35:45.239" style="s2">Otherwise, I&#39;ll hide you anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:35:46.639" end="01:35:50.280" style="s2">Yes, Marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:35:51.679" end="01:35:56.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The blood test results are in. That</p>
<p begin="01:35:54.080" end="01:35:59.159" style="s2">won&#39;t be necessary.</p>
<p begin="01:35:56.159" end="01:35:59.159" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:36:00.880" end="01:36:07.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young Marshall, did I do wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:36:04.560" end="01:36:10.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I get the second concubine killed?</p>
<p begin="01:36:07.280" end="01:36:13.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In her time, maybe things wouldn&#39;t be so</p>
<p begin="01:36:10.000" end="01:36:16.639" style="s2">brutal. It&#39;s not your fault. The</p>
<p begin="01:36:13.440" end="01:36:18.960" style="s2">marshall is ruthless. years ago, his own</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.639" end="01:36:20.560" style="s2">brother met the same fate at his hands.</p>
<p begin="01:36:18.960" end="01:36:23.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go to the hospital tomorrow and</p>
<p begin="01:36:20.560" end="01:36:25.440" style="s2">see Nanny. Once Nanny recovers, we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:36:23.280" end="01:36:26.719" style="s2">bring her to the Yen residence. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:36:25.440" end="01:36:28.320" style="s2">never come back to the Marshall&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.719" end="01:36:30.880" style="s2">mansion again. All right.</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.320" end="01:36:33.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Whatever the young madam</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.880" end="01:36:33.880" style="s2">says.</p>
<p begin="01:36:34.000" end="01:36:35.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="01:36:34.719" end="01:36:37.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; where are you two going?</p>
<p begin="01:36:35.840" end="01:36:37.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re going to the hospital to see</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.120" end="01:36:39.600" style="s2">Nanny.</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.920" end="01:36:44.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect. I have something to bring to</p>
<p begin="01:36:39.600" end="01:36:44.440" style="s2">madam. Cha, come with me.</p>
<p begin="01:36:45.679" end="01:36:51.760" style="s2">Wait for me.</p>
<p begin="01:36:49.040" end="01:36:53.520" style="s2">Lucine is most likely</p>
<p begin="01:36:51.760" end="01:36:56.239" style="s2">Professor Aiki.</p>
<p begin="01:36:53.520" end="01:36:58.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you find out, father?</p>
<p begin="01:36:56.239" end="01:36:59.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t concern yourself with how I found</p>
<p begin="01:36:58.000" end="01:37:01.920" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:36:59.679" end="01:37:04.400" style="s2">I&#39;m only telling you this. I want her to</p>
<p begin="01:37:01.920" end="01:37:07.520" style="s2">be my woman.</p>
<p begin="01:37:04.400" end="01:37:09.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s your daughter-in-law.</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.520" end="01:37:12.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daughter-in-law? So what? Gene has</p>
<p begin="01:37:09.920" end="01:37:15.760" style="s2">already been moved somewhere else by me.</p>
<p begin="01:37:12.639" end="01:37:19.159" style="s2">Between Gene and Lucin, you can only</p>
<p begin="01:37:15.760" end="01:37:19.159" style="s2">choose one.</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.960" end="01:37:24.679" style="s2">What did you do to nanny?</p>
<p begin="01:37:25.040" end="01:37:30.960" style="s2">Go on, aim at your own father.</p>
<p begin="01:37:28.239" end="01:37:34.360" style="s2">Pull the trigger. I&#39;ll make your nanny</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.960" end="01:37:34.360" style="s2">die with me.</p>
<p begin="01:37:35.119" end="01:37:40.239" style="s2">Lucine,</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.600" end="01:37:41.920" style="s2">is that you? Touch her and see what</p>
<p begin="01:37:40.239" end="01:37:46.080" style="s2">happens.</p>
<p begin="01:37:41.920" end="01:37:50.679" style="s2">Lucian, since you&#39;ve heard everything,</p>
<p begin="01:37:46.080" end="01:37:50.679" style="s2">then you make the decision for Chong Yi.</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.280" end="01:38:05.600" style="s2">Why is it you? Why are father and big</p>
<p begin="01:38:02.000" end="01:38:08.320" style="s2">brother fighting again? I I just came to</p>
<p begin="01:38:05.600" end="01:38:10.000" style="s2">deliver the stolen goods.</p>
<p begin="01:38:08.320" end="01:38:12.639" style="s2">Ma told me to dig up the wine buried in</p>
<p begin="01:38:10.000" end="01:38:14.960" style="s2">the ground. Found this wooden box hidden</p>
<p begin="01:38:12.639" end="01:38:16.800" style="s2">by the steward.</p>
<p begin="01:38:14.960" end="01:38:19.800" style="s2">I saw him sneaking around digging there</p>
<p begin="01:38:16.800" end="01:38:19.800" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="01:38:30.080" end="01:38:35.600" style="s2">He deserved to die.</p>
<p begin="01:38:32.719" end="01:38:38.159" style="s2">Yan Chong Yi, you listen to me. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.600" end="01:38:39.840" style="s2">give you 3 days to think it over.</p>
<p begin="01:38:38.159" end="01:38:42.000" style="s2">Otherwise,</p>
<p begin="01:38:39.840" end="01:38:45.000" style="s2">I can&#39;t guarantee I won&#39;t do something</p>
<p begin="01:38:42.000" end="01:38:45.000" style="s2">unspeakable.</p>
<p begin="01:38:48.480" end="01:38:52.760" style="s2">So, I&#39;m the legendary ninth concubine.</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.960" end="01:39:04.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want you to become the ninth</p>
<p begin="01:39:02.480" end="01:39:05.360" style="s2">concubine.</p>
<p begin="01:39:04.480" end="01:39:07.360" style="s2">How did you</p>
<p begin="01:39:05.360" end="01:39:11.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can hear your inner thoughts. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:39:07.360" end="01:39:12.960" style="s2">been able to from the very start.</p>
<p begin="01:39:11.119" end="01:39:14.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nanny Yan Chanya&#39;s jeans are this</p>
<p begin="01:39:12.960" end="01:39:16.800" style="s2">exceptional.</p>
<p begin="01:39:14.960" end="01:39:18.639" style="s2">If he loved me madly and insisted on</p>
<p begin="01:39:16.800" end="01:39:22.199" style="s2">having a child with me, I wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:39:18.639" end="01:39:22.199" style="s2">exactly say no.</p>
<p begin="01:39:22.400" end="01:39:28.159" style="s2">I just drank water from the teapot.</p>
<p begin="01:39:25.840" end="01:39:31.520" style="s2">So hot.</p>
<p begin="01:39:28.159" end="01:39:33.760" style="s2">Feel it. Is my heart racing?</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.520" end="01:39:35.600" style="s2">I know this trope inside out. I fake</p>
<p begin="01:39:33.760" end="01:39:39.320" style="s2">being drugged.</p>
<p begin="01:39:35.600" end="01:39:39.320" style="s2">Then sleep with you.</p>
<p begin="01:39:40.159" end="01:39:43.360" style="s2">Then</p>
<p begin="01:39:41.840" end="01:39:46.320" style="s2">the things I said in my heart.</p>
<p begin="01:39:43.360" end="01:39:50.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All those inner thoughts you had. I</p>
<p begin="01:39:46.320" end="01:39:50.679" style="s2">loved hearing every one of them.</p>
<p begin="01:39:54.719" end="01:39:59.600" style="s2">But for some reason,</p>
<p begin="01:39:58.159" end="01:40:00.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; the marshall can hear your thoughts,</p>
<p begin="01:39:59.600" end="01:40:04.679" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="01:40:00.880" end="01:40:04.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He really can hear them.</p>
<p begin="01:40:05.199" end="01:40:09.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m afraid he&#39;ll hurt you. That&#39;s why I</p>
<p begin="01:40:07.679" end="01:40:12.199" style="s2">wanted to send you back to where you</p>
<p begin="01:40:09.040" end="01:40:12.199" style="s2">came from.</p>
<p begin="01:40:13.040" end="01:40:18.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yana,</p>
<p begin="01:40:14.880" end="01:40:18.679" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to leave you.</p>
<p begin="01:40:22.560" end="01:40:30.040" style="s2">I can&#39;t bear to either, but</p>
<p begin="01:40:25.360" end="01:40:30.040" style="s2">this era is far too dangerous.</p>
<p begin="01:40:30.320" end="01:40:35.360" style="s2">I have a plan to eliminate Marshall Yen,</p>
<p begin="01:40:33.760" end="01:40:37.520" style="s2">but it requires you to shed a little</p>
<p begin="01:40:35.360" end="01:40:39.760" style="s2">blood.</p>
<p begin="01:40:37.520" end="01:40:41.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A</p>
<p begin="01:40:39.760" end="01:40:43.440" style="s2">I&#39;m willing to sacrifice my life for</p>
<p begin="01:40:41.760" end="01:40:44.880" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:40:43.440" end="01:40:47.880" style="s2">Just promise me you&#39;ll take care of</p>
<p begin="01:40:44.880" end="01:40:47.880" style="s2">nanny.</p>
<p begin="01:40:51.119" end="01:40:55.639" style="s2">Yan Chanya, I won&#39;t let you die.</p>
<p begin="01:40:56.320" end="01:41:02.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why so sorrowful?</p>
<p begin="01:40:59.199" end="01:41:04.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young Marshall off to fight bandits.</p>
<p begin="01:41:02.880" end="01:41:07.199" style="s2">Every time he comes back from outside,</p>
<p begin="01:41:04.800" end="01:41:09.199" style="s2">he&#39;s covered in blood. What if one day</p>
<p begin="01:41:07.199" end="01:41:10.320" style="s2">something happens to him? What will I do</p>
<p begin="01:41:09.199" end="01:41:13.119" style="s2">then?</p>
<p begin="01:41:10.320" end="01:41:16.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. The Marshall&#39;s mansion will</p>
<p begin="01:41:13.119" end="01:41:16.600" style="s2">take care of you.</p>
<p begin="01:41:24.480" end="01:41:29.119" style="s2">Take men in disguise to the outskirts.</p>
<p begin="01:41:26.239" end="01:41:33.800" style="s2">Ambush Yian. He absolutely cannot come</p>
<p begin="01:41:29.119" end="01:41:33.800" style="s2">back alive. Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:41:34.080" end="01:41:38.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The second young master says he&#39;s too</p>
<p begin="01:41:35.679" end="01:41:40.000" style="s2">unwell to come. Why isn&#39;t Yan Chonga</p>
<p begin="01:41:38.080" end="01:41:42.719" style="s2">back yet?</p>
<p begin="01:41:40.000" end="01:41:45.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall. Young Marshall shot. He fell</p>
<p begin="01:41:42.719" end="01:41:48.280" style="s2">into the lake. His fate is unknown.</p>
<p begin="01:41:45.280" end="01:41:48.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:41:48.480" end="01:41:52.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young Madam Marshall, let&#39;s get the</p>
<p begin="01:41:50.239" end="01:41:55.520" style="s2">young madam to the hospital. Hurry and</p>
<p begin="01:41:52.880" end="01:41:59.159" style="s2">send someone to find the young Marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:41:55.520" end="01:41:59.159" style="s2">Away, go.</p>
<p begin="01:42:06.320" end="01:42:12.719" style="s2">You saw Yen shot into the lake.</p>
<p begin="01:42:10.159" end="01:42:16.159" style="s2">Yes, he bled a lot. Even if they fish</p>
<p begin="01:42:12.719" end="01:42:18.159" style="s2">him out, he&#39;s definitely not breathing.</p>
<p begin="01:42:16.159" end="01:42:20.719" style="s2">Yan Chonga,</p>
<p begin="01:42:18.159" end="01:42:23.600" style="s2">don&#39;t blame me for being ruthless.</p>
<p begin="01:42:20.719" end="01:42:27.480" style="s2">I only need a puppet, son.</p>
<p begin="01:42:23.600" end="01:42:27.480" style="s2">And you&#39;re far too outstanding.</p>
<p begin="01:42:28.719" end="01:42:35.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s not disturb the young madam&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:42:30.639" end="01:42:35.400" style="s2">rest. Let&#39;s go, Ho.</p>
<p begin="01:42:45.119" end="01:42:51.520" style="s2">You are you hurt? Where are you injured?</p>
<p begin="01:42:49.040" end="01:42:54.880" style="s2">You swam back.</p>
<p begin="01:42:51.520" end="01:42:57.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re pressing on my wound.</p>
<p begin="01:42:54.880" end="01:42:59.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:42:57.840" end="01:43:01.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank goodness for the shield you gave</p>
<p begin="01:42:59.440" end="01:43:02.080" style="s2">me. It kept the vital spots for being</p>
<p begin="01:43:01.600" end="01:43:04.320" style="s2">hit.</p>
<p begin="01:43:02.080" end="01:43:08.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest easy. We bribed your attending</p>
<p begin="01:43:04.320" end="01:43:09.840" style="s2">physician. You rest and recover here.</p>
<p begin="01:43:08.000" end="01:43:14.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did I</p>
<p begin="01:43:09.840" end="01:43:14.679" style="s2">get so lucky to marry you?</p>
<p begin="01:43:15.040" end="01:43:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, get better soon so I can get some</p>
<p begin="01:43:17.040" end="01:43:20.800" style="s2">sleep.</p>
<p begin="01:43:18.880" end="01:43:23.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young madam,</p>
<p begin="01:43:20.800" end="01:43:27.440" style="s2">you&#39;re really something.</p>
<p begin="01:43:23.600" end="01:43:30.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was just trying to make you happy.</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.440" end="01:43:32.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young madam,</p>
<p begin="01:43:30.400" end="01:43:35.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; we need to head back soon. The marshall</p>
<p begin="01:43:32.719" end="01:43:37.520" style="s2">gets suspicious easily. All right,</p>
<p begin="01:43:35.679" end="01:43:40.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; much obliged. No need for thanks,</p>
<p begin="01:43:37.520" end="01:43:42.960" style="s2">brother. Awa will surely help you become</p>
<p begin="01:43:40.000" end="01:43:45.600" style="s2">the marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:43:42.960" end="01:43:47.119" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young madam won&#39;t eat or drink. This</p>
<p begin="01:43:45.600" end="01:43:48.639" style="s2">can&#39;t go on.</p>
<p begin="01:43:47.119" end="01:43:50.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nanny,</p>
<p begin="01:43:48.639" end="01:43:52.719" style="s2">I want to see nanny.</p>
<p begin="01:43:50.080" end="01:43:55.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall, how about you bring Madam to</p>
<p begin="01:43:52.719" end="01:43:56.880" style="s2">the Marshall&#39;s mansion to recuperate?</p>
<p begin="01:43:55.360" end="01:43:58.159" style="s2">That way, I can take care of both young</p>
<p begin="01:43:56.880" end="01:44:01.440" style="s2">Madam and Madam.</p>
<p begin="01:43:58.159" end="01:44:03.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yan Chong&#39;s fate is unknown. First, keep</p>
<p begin="01:44:01.440" end="01:44:05.920" style="s2">Lucien stable and use her for my</p>
<p begin="01:44:03.520" end="01:44:07.760" style="s2">purposes.</p>
<p begin="01:44:05.920" end="01:44:09.840" style="s2">If something happened to Cha, don&#39;t tell</p>
<p begin="01:44:07.760" end="01:44:10.960" style="s2">her yet. Gene one won&#39;t be able to</p>
<p begin="01:44:09.840" end="01:44:13.960" style="s2">handle it.</p>
<p begin="01:44:10.960" end="01:44:13.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:44:19.360" end="01:44:23.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next step.</p>
<p begin="01:44:21.440" end="01:44:25.760" style="s2">Spread the word across the city that I</p>
<p begin="01:44:23.040" end="01:44:29.520" style="s2">am Professor Ai Cassie.</p>
<p begin="01:44:25.760" end="01:44:31.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister-in-law. Why?</p>
<p begin="01:44:29.520" end="01:44:33.840" style="s2">I still have a card up my sleeve.</p>
<p begin="01:44:31.600" end="01:44:37.840" style="s2">Marshall Yan&#39;s foundation is solid. He</p>
<p begin="01:44:33.840" end="01:44:41.199" style="s2">can&#39;t be toppled easily. We can leverage</p>
<p begin="01:44:37.840" end="01:44:43.119" style="s2">Jang Hanha&#39;s military forces.</p>
<p begin="01:44:41.199" end="01:44:45.679" style="s2">What do you say? Is actually Professor</p>
<p begin="01:44:43.119" end="01:44:46.880" style="s2">Ay. Yes, the marshall&#39;s wife. The car</p>
<p begin="01:44:45.679" end="01:44:48.560" style="s2">accident. Excessive blood loss. It was</p>
<p begin="01:44:46.880" end="01:44:50.560" style="s2">also Lucin who brought the marshall&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:44:48.560" end="01:44:54.480" style="s2">wife back from the dead. The whole city</p>
<p begin="01:44:50.560" end="01:44:56.080" style="s2">knows by now. Good. Prepare a hefty sum</p>
<p begin="01:44:54.480" end="01:44:59.080" style="s2">and head to the marshall&#39;s mansion at</p>
<p begin="01:44:56.080" end="01:44:59.080" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="01:45:00.000" end="01:45:06.159" style="s2">Nanny, it&#39;s my fault. I didn&#39;t take good</p>
<p begin="01:45:03.920" end="01:45:07.840" style="s2">care of Chonga. I will take good care of</p>
<p begin="01:45:06.159" end="01:45:11.520" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:45:07.840" end="01:45:13.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be too heartbroken.</p>
<p begin="01:45:11.520" end="01:45:15.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall,</p>
<p begin="01:45:13.280" end="01:45:17.760" style="s2">you must find the young Marshall. I want</p>
<p begin="01:45:15.360" end="01:45:22.480" style="s2">him alive or dead.</p>
<p begin="01:45:17.760" end="01:45:24.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still searching, but it&#39;s been 2 days.</p>
<p begin="01:45:22.480" end="01:45:25.280" style="s2">You need to prepare yourself for the</p>
<p begin="01:45:24.000" end="01:45:28.600" style="s2">worst,</p>
<p begin="01:45:25.280" end="01:45:28.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; man claims.</p>
<p begin="01:45:32.080" end="01:45:36.239" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know back then that the young</p>
<p begin="01:45:33.360" end="01:45:39.719" style="s2">Marshall&#39;s wife was Professor AI. Truly,</p>
<p begin="01:45:36.239" end="01:45:39.719" style="s2">I was rude.</p>
<p begin="01:45:44.000" end="01:45:47.840" style="s2">This is a generous gift I specially</p>
<p begin="01:45:45.440" end="01:45:50.560" style="s2">prepared. If Professor Aikus can heal my</p>
<p begin="01:45:47.840" end="01:45:51.679" style="s2">face, whatever you need, I will spare no</p>
<p begin="01:45:50.560" end="01:45:53.600" style="s2">effort.</p>
<p begin="01:45:51.679" end="01:45:55.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few trinkets like this. The treasures</p>
<p begin="01:45:53.600" end="01:45:58.360" style="s2">hidden in his city god temple. Ming</p>
<p begin="01:45:55.360" end="01:45:58.360" style="s2">relics.</p>
<p begin="01:45:58.400" end="01:46:01.719" style="s2">great wealth</p>
<p begin="01:46:01.840" end="01:46:07.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; giving me this little. Who do you think</p>
<p begin="01:46:03.600" end="01:46:07.239" style="s2">you&#39;re looking down on</p>
<p begin="01:46:15.280" end="01:46:19.600" style="s2">Jung Hanjo? I need to borrow your troops</p>
<p begin="01:46:17.280" end="01:46:21.920" style="s2">to kill Marshall Yen.</p>
<p begin="01:46:19.600" end="01:46:24.639" style="s2">Take this pill. You&#39;ll see results in 3</p>
<p begin="01:46:21.920" end="01:46:27.040" style="s2">hours.</p>
<p begin="01:46:24.639" end="01:46:28.639" style="s2">Marshall Yen killed the young Marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:46:27.040" end="01:46:30.880" style="s2">I want you to avenge me.</p>
<p begin="01:46:28.639" end="01:46:35.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The young Marshall is dead. One less</p>
<p begin="01:46:30.880" end="01:46:35.800" style="s2">rival. Restore Ching.</p>
<p begin="01:46:36.400" end="01:46:41.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marshall Yan also killed the second</p>
<p begin="01:46:37.520" end="01:46:41.400" style="s2">concubine at temple.</p>
<p begin="01:46:41.840" end="01:46:45.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Setting up an inescapable trap. You just</p>
<p begin="01:46:43.920" end="01:46:48.400" style="s2">need to help him succeed. Then bring me</p>
<p begin="01:46:45.760" end="01:46:53.880" style="s2">Marshall Yan&#39;s head.</p>
<p begin="01:46:48.400" end="01:46:53.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young madam, wait for my good news.</p>
<p begin="01:46:54.719" end="01:46:59.840" style="s2">Young madam, the second young marshall</p>
<p begin="01:46:56.800" end="01:47:03.520" style="s2">had no such plan. We say it&#39;s him, so</p>
<p begin="01:46:59.840" end="01:47:05.280" style="s2">it&#39;s him. Now,</p>
<p begin="01:47:03.520" end="01:47:08.280" style="s2">let&#39;s go pay the second young marshall a</p>
<p begin="01:47:05.280" end="01:47:08.280" style="s2">visit.</p>
<p begin="01:47:15.199" end="01:47:21.080" style="s2">Get lost. Are you here to laugh at me,</p>
<p begin="01:47:18.080" end="01:47:21.080" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="01:47:23.309" end="01:47:25.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:47:25.520" end="01:47:29.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Second, young Marshall. The marshall</p>
<p begin="01:47:27.119" end="01:47:31.679" style="s2">killed your mother. Don&#39;t you want to</p>
<p begin="01:47:29.600" end="01:47:34.400" style="s2">kill him with your own hands? I just got</p>
<p begin="01:47:31.679" end="01:47:36.639" style="s2">word.</p>
<p begin="01:47:34.400" end="01:47:38.639" style="s2">Jang Hanjo is at the city god temple.</p>
<p begin="01:47:36.639" end="01:47:40.880" style="s2">He&#39;s laid a trap, ready to assassinate</p>
<p begin="01:47:38.639" end="01:47:43.920" style="s2">the marshall. Such a perfect chance to</p>
<p begin="01:47:40.880" end="01:47:48.520" style="s2">slay your own father. Don&#39;t let it slip.</p>
<p begin="01:47:43.920" end="01:47:48.520" style="s2">Second young marshall. Yan Chongua,</p>
<p begin="01:47:48.800" end="01:47:52.639" style="s2">don&#39;t shame yourself. Don&#39;t fail the</p>
<p begin="01:47:50.800" end="01:47:55.520" style="s2">marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:47:52.639" end="01:47:57.040" style="s2">Come back alive.</p>
<p begin="01:47:55.520" end="01:47:59.199" style="s2">The more people who want him dead, the</p>
<p begin="01:47:57.040" end="01:48:01.840" style="s2">better our odds. Young madam, you&#39;re as</p>
<p begin="01:47:59.199" end="01:48:06.119" style="s2">clever as they come. Away and I are glad</p>
<p begin="01:48:01.840" end="01:48:06.119" style="s2">to serve you and the young marshall.</p>
<p begin="01:48:07.199" end="01:48:10.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my, so many national treasures and</p>
<p begin="01:48:08.960" end="01:48:16.320" style="s2">relics here.</p>
<p begin="01:48:10.960" end="01:48:16.320" style="s2">Everyone, be careful. Dig them all out.</p>
<p begin="01:48:18.719" end="01:48:24.280" style="s2">Protect the marshall. This is a trap.</p>
<p begin="01:48:26.480" end="01:48:30.639" style="s2">Weren&#39;t the [snorts] second marshall&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:48:27.679" end="01:48:35.639" style="s2">men coming?</p>
<p begin="01:48:30.639" end="01:48:35.639" style="s2">Yan Chanya, you&#39;re actually still alive.</p>
<p begin="01:48:37.840" end="01:48:42.239" style="s2">You killed my mother. Your time has</p>
<p begin="01:48:39.920" end="01:48:45.520" style="s2">come. You joined forces with outsiders</p>
<p begin="01:48:42.239" end="01:48:45.520" style="s2">to set me up.</p>
<p begin="01:48:45.920" end="01:48:49.679" style="s2">Marshall, you reap what you sow. Did you</p>
<p begin="01:48:47.760" end="01:48:52.719" style="s2">really think</p>
<p begin="01:48:49.679" end="01:48:56.480" style="s2">you could escape being torn apart?</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.719" end="01:48:58.719" style="s2">By your own flesh and blood?</p>
<p begin="01:48:56.480" end="01:49:00.560" style="s2">Oh, I&#39;ve lost. It&#39;s all because of my</p>
<p begin="01:48:58.719" end="01:49:03.719" style="s2">own foolish ignorance that I&#39;ve fallen</p>
<p begin="01:49:00.560" end="01:49:03.719" style="s2">to this.</p>
<p begin="01:49:07.600" end="01:49:13.960" style="s2">Marshall,</p>
<p begin="01:49:09.520" end="01:49:13.960" style="s2">I swear to follow you unto death.</p>
<p begin="01:49:22.080" end="01:49:29.760" style="s2">What we need is an era of peace, not an</p>
<p begin="01:49:25.600" end="01:49:33.480" style="s2">era of war, united in sincerity together</p>
<p begin="01:49:29.760" end="01:49:33.480" style="s2">toward tranquility.</p>
<p begin="01:49:41.520" end="01:49:45.960" style="s2">Aeen, I missed you so much.</p>
<p begin="01:49:53.119" end="01:49:57.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re making me so ticklish.</p>
<p begin="01:49:59.679" end="01:50:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aen, this era might not be as advanced</p>
<p begin="01:50:03.040" end="01:50:06.000" style="s2">as yours. Is there anything I can do to</p>
<p begin="01:50:05.360" end="01:50:08.560" style="s2">help you?</p>
<p begin="01:50:06.000" end="01:50:12.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to join the research institute</p>
<p begin="01:50:08.560" end="01:50:12.480" style="s2">and pass on everything I know.</p>
<p begin="01:50:12.719" end="01:50:17.719" style="s2">All right, A. What was your era like?</p>
<p begin="01:50:18.719" end="01:50:24.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By my count, I come from a 100 years</p>
<p begin="01:50:20.719" end="01:50:26.800" style="s2">from now. In our time, it&#39;s monogamy.</p>
<p begin="01:50:24.159" end="01:50:29.760" style="s2">Can&#39;t be like Marshall Yen.</p>
<p begin="01:50:26.800" end="01:50:32.719" style="s2">Marrying eight concubines at once.</p>
<p begin="01:50:29.760" end="01:50:35.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you throwing shade at me?</p>
<p begin="01:50:32.719" end="01:50:37.840" style="s2">I&#39;m just worried that in your era, a</p>
<p begin="01:50:35.679" end="01:50:39.679" style="s2">woman could have eight men at the same</p>
<p begin="01:50:37.840" end="01:50:42.320" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="01:50:39.679" end="01:50:45.360" style="s2">If you ever dare fall for another man,</p>
<p begin="01:50:42.320" end="01:50:48.920" style="s2">I&#39;ll shoot him dead.</p>
<p begin="01:50:45.360" end="01:50:48.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You petty thing.</p>
<p begin="01:50:54.719" end="01:50:59.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These past 3 years, you&#39;ve published</p>
<p begin="01:50:57.199" end="01:51:01.280" style="s2">dozens of academic papers devoted to</p>
<p begin="01:50:59.440" end="01:51:03.360" style="s2">scientific research, saved so many</p>
<p begin="01:51:01.280" end="01:51:07.080" style="s2">lives. Now that you&#39;re back, can you</p>
<p begin="01:51:03.360" end="01:51:07.080" style="s2">spend some time with me?</p>
<p begin="01:51:10.639" end="01:51:15.159" style="s2">Is the young Marshall begging for</p>
<p begin="01:51:12.159" end="01:51:15.159" style="s2">affection?</p>
<p begin="01:51:15.520" end="01:51:22.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m begging you. Don&#39;t on me, please.</p>
<p begin="01:51:19.440" end="01:51:26.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, then that depends on</p>
<p begin="01:51:22.719" end="01:51:26.679" style="s2">the young Marshall&#39;s abilities.</p>
<p begin="01:51:32.719" end="01:51:36.239" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what&#39;s been going on</p>
<p begin="01:51:34.000" end="01:51:38.560" style="s2">lately. I get tired so easily for no</p>
<p begin="01:51:36.239" end="01:51:40.480" style="s2">reason. Marshall, you&#39;re back. Madam has</p>
<p begin="01:51:38.560" end="01:51:42.719" style="s2">been craving sour plums lately, and</p>
<p begin="01:51:40.480" end="01:51:46.840" style="s2">she&#39;s always exhausted.</p>
<p begin="01:51:42.719" end="01:51:46.840" style="s2">I wonder if she might be.</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.520" end="01:51:52.960" style="s2">Quick, get the traditional physician.</p>
<p begin="01:51:50.000" end="01:51:54.719" style="s2">Hurry.</p>
<p begin="01:51:52.960" end="01:51:56.719" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, Marshall. Madam, it&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:51:54.719" end="01:52:01.239" style="s2">blessed pulse. She&#39;s with child. Madam</p>
<p begin="01:51:56.719" end="01:52:01.239" style="s2">has been with child for two months now.</p>
<p begin="01:52:01.599" end="01:52:07.119" style="s2">Thank you, Dr. Marshall. Take good care</p>
<p begin="01:52:03.679" end="01:52:08.892" style="s2">of madam. I&#39;ll take my leave. See Dr.</p>
<p begin="01:52:07.119" end="01:52:10.912" style="s2">Chinow.</p>
<p begin="01:52:08.892" end="01:52:10.912" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:52:13.760" end="01:52:18.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aim. We&#39;re having a baby.</p>
<p begin="01:52:18.239" end="01:52:22.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But once the baby comes, my career.</p>
<p begin="01:52:23.040" end="01:52:27.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. Once the baby&#39;s born, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:52:25.040" end="01:52:30.719" style="s2">raise it. The baby, second, and third</p>
<p begin="01:52:27.679" end="01:52:33.800" style="s2">uncle are here. Go do your thing.</p>
<p begin="01:52:30.719" end="01:52:33.800" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="01:52:34.080" end="01:52:39.679" style="s2">How are you this wonderful?</p>
<p begin="01:52:37.440" end="01:52:43.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="01:52:39.679" end="01:52:45.599" style="s2">in this era having a baby is rough. The</p>
<p begin="01:52:43.599" end="01:52:47.760" style="s2">medical conditions now, they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:52:45.599" end="01:52:49.599" style="s2">definitely not as good as a 100 years</p>
<p begin="01:52:47.760" end="01:52:51.840" style="s2">from now.</p>
<p begin="01:52:49.599" end="01:52:54.880" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry you have to go through this.</p>
<p begin="01:52:51.840" end="01:52:58.080" style="s2">Pick whatever you want. No limits.</p>
<p begin="01:52:54.880" end="01:52:59.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Third young Marshall. I want this one.</p>
<p begin="01:52:58.080" end="01:53:02.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And this one. And this one.</p>
<p begin="01:52:59.520" end="01:53:04.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Yes. Yes. Buy them all.</p>
<p begin="01:53:02.400" end="01:53:07.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young Marshall, I want this one.</p>
<p begin="01:53:04.560" end="01:53:07.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Buy it.</p>
<p begin="01:53:08.080" end="01:53:11.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, the little terror&#39;s about to wake</p>
<p begin="01:53:09.679" end="01:53:14.000" style="s2">up. I got to hurry back and take care of</p>
<p begin="01:53:11.599" end="01:53:15.520" style="s2">the kid. You all just buy whatever you</p>
<p begin="01:53:14.000" end="01:53:17.920" style="s2">want.</p>
<p begin="01:53:15.520" end="01:53:19.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young Marshall, since when does the</p>
<p begin="01:53:17.920" end="01:53:22.239" style="s2">young Marshall have a kid?</p>
<p begin="01:53:19.920" end="01:53:24.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Helping the marshall with the kid. Him</p>
<p begin="01:53:22.239" end="01:53:29.599" style="s2">and third young Marshall take turns.</p>
<p begin="01:53:24.960" end="01:53:33.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Second uncle, you&#39;re back. Hey,</p>
<p begin="01:53:29.599" end="01:53:33.320" style="s2">time to learn shooting.</p>
<p begin="01:53:33.440" end="01:53:36.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Aren&#39;t you afraid Chang will come</p>
<p begin="01:53:35.440" end="01:53:38.639" style="s2">back and scold you?</p>
<p begin="01:53:36.400" end="01:53:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shooting. Shooting.</p>
<p begin="01:53:38.639" end="01:53:42.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nanny, just leave the kid with me. You</p>
<p begin="01:53:40.480" end="01:53:43.840" style="s2">can relax completely. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:53:42.480" end="01:53:45.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, you&#39;re going to take years off my</p>
<p begin="01:53:43.840" end="01:53:48.480" style="s2">life. I swear.</p>
<p begin="01:53:45.760" end="01:53:51.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aim for the bullseye. Eyes forward. Come</p>
<p begin="01:53:48.480" end="01:53:54.840" style="s2">on. Second uncle take a shot for you.</p>
<p begin="01:53:51.840" end="01:53:54.840" style="s2">Watch.</p>
<p begin="01:53:55.360" end="01:54:00.159" style="s2">Did you learn? It&#39;s such a big target,</p>
<p begin="01:53:58.000" end="01:54:01.920" style="s2">you little terror. You just got to hit</p>
<p begin="01:54:00.159" end="01:54:02.960" style="s2">the target. Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:54:01.920" end="01:54:08.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:54:02.960" end="01:54:09.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. You got this. You&#39;re the best.</p>
<p begin="01:54:08.000" end="01:54:11.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Second uncle. Is it [clears throat] like</p>
<p begin="01:54:09.760" end="01:54:14.639" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="01:54:11.679" end="01:54:17.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. Just like Yan Chonga&#39;s kid,</p>
<p begin="01:54:14.639" end="01:54:21.080" style="s2">huh? No, wait. This thing&#39;s all the</p>
<p begin="01:54:17.840" end="01:54:21.080" style="s2">same, though.</p>
<p begin="01:54:21.360" end="01:54:25.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uggh. Number two. You&#39;ve been improving</p>
<p begin="01:54:23.679" end="01:54:28.320" style="s2">by leaps and bounds lately.</p>
<p begin="01:54:25.520" end="01:54:29.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, mommy, the one in the middle is</p>
<p begin="01:54:28.320" end="01:54:31.679" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="01:54:29.840" end="01:54:34.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, give your second uncle some</p>
<p begin="01:54:31.679" end="01:54:37.599" style="s2">face, would you?</p>
<p begin="01:54:34.639" end="01:54:40.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boring. If I ever babysit for you again,</p>
<p begin="01:54:37.599" end="01:54:42.639" style="s2">I&#39;m a dog.</p>
<p begin="01:54:40.480" end="01:54:44.239" style="s2">Really? That&#39;s great. Then let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:54:42.639" end="01:54:47.440" style="s2">From now on, you&#39;ll play with third</p>
<p begin="01:54:44.239" end="01:54:50.800" style="s2">uncle. No way. Let go. The kid&#39;s mine</p>
<p begin="01:54:47.440" end="01:54:55.199" style="s2">today. I&#39;m not letting go. Who just said</p>
<p begin="01:54:50.800" end="01:54:58.960" style="s2">whoever babysits again is a dog?</p>
<p begin="01:54:55.199" end="01:55:02.760" style="s2">Woof woof woof woof. All right. All</p>
<p begin="01:54:58.960" end="01:55:02.760" style="s2">right. Come here.</p>
<p begin="01:55:03.679" end="01:55:07.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today I need to discuss something with</p>
<p begin="01:55:05.520" end="01:55:10.320" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:55:07.760" end="01:55:12.239" style="s2">Baby, mommy has to go to the States for</p>
<p begin="01:55:10.320" end="01:55:13.920" style="s2">a while, exchange and study. I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="01:55:12.239" end="01:55:19.400" style="s2">right back as soon as it&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="01:55:13.920" end="01:55:19.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Mommy, I&#39;ll miss you.</p>
<p begin="01:55:26.000" end="01:55:29.599" style="s2">All right, I&#39;ll have Xiao Yuan accompany</p>
<p begin="01:55:28.080" end="01:55:33.880" style="s2">you the whole time.</p>
<p begin="01:55:29.599" end="01:55:33.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm. Hubby, I&#39;ll miss you.</p>
<p begin="01:55:36.320" end="01:55:41.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why does mommy always have to leave?</p>
<p begin="01:55:39.119" end="01:55:44.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because she&#39;s not just your mother.</p>
<p begin="01:55:41.599" end="01:55:45.920" style="s2">She&#39;s a scientist. And this this is her</p>
<p begin="01:55:44.320" end="01:55:48.719" style="s2">dream.</p>
<p begin="01:55:45.920" end="01:55:50.800" style="s2">We have to support her. Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:55:48.719" end="01:55:55.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy&#39;s the best. The most amazing</p>
<p begin="01:55:50.800" end="01:55:55.080" style="s2">person. You got this.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
